(377891, 31849, 811, '<td valign="top">Great sense of humor here.  The glares are a little distracting, but understandable.  Hope you don''t get nailed too badly for the "adventure."  I like it.</td>', 'Great sense of humor here.  The glares are a little distracting, but understandable.  Hope you don''t get nailed too badly for the "adventure."  I like it.', '2003-08-06 01:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
