(378647, 31937, 5728, '<td valign="top">So the world really is flat? Thanx for proving to us once and for all :-) I''m not to keen on how the frame disappears into the blackness at the bottom, but other than that it''s good.</td>', 'So the world really is flat? Thanx for proving to us once and for all :-) I''m not to keen on how the frame disappears into the blackness at the bottom, but other than that it''s good.', '2003-08-06 11:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
