(378656, 32156, 5728, '<td valign="top">I just love this one. The sepia works so well here, and the motion blur on the rubble he''s pushing off the wall is very fitting.</td>', 'I just love this one. The sepia works so well here, and the motion blur on the rubble he''s pushing off the wall is very fitting.', '2003-08-06 11:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(378659, 31315, 5728, '<td valign="top">The colors are awesome. I love the textures in the starfish. The only reason I''m giving you an 8 instead of a 10 is that those really aren''t true right angles. Did you set up two different colored lamps here?</td>', 'The colors are awesome. I love the textures in the starfish. The only reason I''m giving you an 8 instead of a 10 is that those really aren''t true right angles. Did you set up two different colored lamps here?', '2003-08-06 11:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(378661, 32030, 10739, '<td valign="top">great picture. I really love it</td>', 'great picture. I really love it', '2003-08-06 11:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(378662, 31882, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is very good, especially with the reeds in the water with the sunlight on them. The spider web is really fitting here as well. The only part which is a little distracting for me here is the top left hand corner above the railing. It''s pulling my eyes aways from the rest of the image. Cropping it out would have also cropped out too much of the railing I guess. Maybe a different shooting position might have somehow avoided including that part into your photo - 8.</td>', 'This is very good, especially with the reeds in the water with the sunlight on them. The spider web is really fitting here as well. The only part which is a little distracting for me here is the top left hand corner above the railing. It''s pulling my eyes aways from the rest of the image. Cropping it out would have also cropped out too much of the railing I guess. Maybe a different shooting position might have somehow avoided including that part into your photo - 8.', '2003-08-06 11:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(378664, 31567, 10240, '<td valign="top">Very nice, to bad the exposure isn''t better on the cross.</td>', 'Very nice, to bad the exposure isn''t better on the cross.', '2003-08-06 11:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
