(378679, 31968, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been made stronger by framing it so that the angles were symmetrical. Maybe that just wasn''t possible. A good eye. I would like to see your outakes on this one...</td>', 'I think this could have been made stronger by framing it so that the angles were symmetrical. Maybe that just wasn''t possible. A good eye. I would like to see your outakes on this one...', '2003-08-06 11:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
