(378683, 31265, 5728, '<td valign="top">Amazing how you got the light shining only in that top right segment there. How did you do that? Must have taken a lot of patience and setting up, but it worked!</td>', 'Amazing how you got the light shining only in that top right segment there. How did you do that? Must have taken a lot of patience and setting up, but it worked!', '2003-08-06 11:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
