(378688, 31624, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely crispy blue sky you got there, this almost looks like a postcard shot. The building and the sign seem to be leaning in towards each other, is that what it really looks like?</td>', 'Lovely crispy blue sky you got there, this almost looks like a postcard shot. The building and the sign seem to be leaning in towards each other, is that what it really looks like?', '2003-08-06 11:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
