(378692, 32010, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now this is definitely a different take on right angles, but the right angle definitely is there :-) The low key works well here - 8.</td>', 'Now this is definitely a different take on right angles, but the right angle definitely is there :-) The low key works well here - 8.', '2003-08-06 11:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(378695, 31997, 10240, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done</td>', 'Beautifully done', '2003-08-06 11:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(378696, 31936, 10785, '<td valign="top">Is that the king or queen on the far left? If it''s the king, I think the bishop is on the attack, and therefore just made a stupid move by putting the king in check with the knight right there! Haha, of course, that is why it is going down...<br/> <br/>Very nice shot. I like the color. Did you put a piece of glass over the board to get the reflections? Maybe it''s the opacity of the piece, but the bishop seems to be less sharp than the clearer pieces.</td>', 'Is that the king or queen on the far left? If it''s the king, I think the bishop is on the attack, and therefore just made a stupid move by putting the king in check with the knight right there! Haha, of course, that is why it is going down... Very nice shot. I like the color. Did you put a piece of glass over the board to get the reflections? Maybe it''s the opacity of the piece, but the bishop seems to be less sharp than the clearer pieces.', '2003-08-06 11:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
