(378797, 31931, 9809, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo and the off-angle frame that defines it. Nicely done. However, the theme of this challenge was "Create a photograph where right angles produce the strength of the image." The out of focus fence/rail is not the strength of this image. It is an interesting element -- providing a metaphoric barrier between the young and the old -- a metaphysical generation gap. Hmm. maybe it is the strength of the image, or at least a key element.</td>', 'I really like this photo and the off-angle frame that defines it. Nicely done. However, the theme of this challenge was "Create a photograph where right angles produce the strength of the image." The out of focus fence/rail is not the strength of this image. It is an interesting element -- providing a metaphoric barrier between the young and the old -- a metaphysical generation gap. Hmm. maybe it is the strength of the image, or at least a key element.', '2003-08-06 13:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(378799, 32238, 811, '<td valign="top">Admittedly not an emotional shot for me, but I really like the composition and lighting on this.  Very high-key.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Admittedly not an emotional shot for me, but I really like the composition and lighting on this.  Very high-key.  Nicely done.', '2003-08-06 13:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
