(378803, 31889, 9809, '<td valign="top">I like the off-angle approach of this image and clearly you met the challenge, but the overall gray blur of the photo makes it look like you took the shot through a dirty windshield.</td>', 'I like the off-angle approach of this image and clearly you met the challenge, but the overall gray blur of the photo makes it look like you took the shot through a dirty windshield.', '2003-08-06 13:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
