(379416, 32073, 7743, '<td valign="top">This tree looks like it''s been through the lightning wars.  Great natural shot.  It''s too bad the clouds have very little detail though the yellow on the ground carries this image.  Maybe showing a touch more of the ground would give the image more impact. 7</td>', 'This tree looks like it''s been through the lightning wars.  Great natural shot.  It''s too bad the clouds have very little detail though the yellow on the ground carries this image.  Maybe showing a touch more of the ground would give the image more impact. 7', '2003-08-06 22:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(379423, 31876, 387, '<td valign="top">I very seldom comment on any photos. However, I think this photo is probably one of the most clever interpretations of a challenge I''ve seen yet. At least the way I understand it - light is reflected at a right angle to the human eye which creates color, and the challenge said the strength of you photo must be from right angles. Clearly the strength of the photo is the color. Good job. Thanks for making me think twice.</td>', 'I very seldom comment on any photos. However, I think this photo is probably one of the most clever interpretations of a challenge I''ve seen yet. At least the way I understand it - light is reflected at a right angle to the human eye which creates color, and the challenge said the strength of you photo must be from right angles. Clearly the strength of the photo is the color. Good job. Thanks for making me think twice.', '2003-08-06 22:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(379426, 31379, 2867, '<td valign="top">Why so pixelated? It''s a great idea and set up, but technically it needs major work.</td>', 'Why so pixelated? It''s a great idea and set up, but technically it needs major work.', '2003-08-06 22:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(379427, 31957, 205, '<td valign="top">This is very excellent</td>', 'This is very excellent', '2003-08-06 22:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(379437, 32073, 2223, '<td valign="top">What a ''wow'' luuuuvvv it! 10</td>', 'What a ''wow'' luuuuvvv it! 10', '2003-08-06 22:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(379438, 31806, 8327, '<td valign="top">Right Angles - yes; Strength of the image - No.<br/> <br/>Good picture composition and lighting. If you had a way of removing the reflections it would be even better.</td>', 'Right Angles - yes; Strength of the image - No. Good picture composition and lighting. If you had a way of removing the reflections it would be even better.', '2003-08-06 22:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(379440, 32225, 472, '<td valign="top">amazing colors. the texture is an interesting contrast with the colors within.  the sense of scale is hard to get.  intriguing shot!</td>', 'amazing colors. the texture is an interesting contrast with the colors within.  the sense of scale is hard to get.  intriguing shot!', '2003-08-06 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(379441, 32025, 8327, '<td valign="top">You''re going to get it a lot, so I won''t say it.<br/> <br/>The left portion of the pic would make a good jigsaw puzzle.</td>', 'You''re going to get it a lot, so I won''t say it. The left portion of the pic would make a good jigsaw puzzle.', '2003-08-06 22:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(379442, 32176, 1717, '<td valign="top">very cool!  i love all the different textures!...and that little rainbow reflection in the top  of the sculpture...great detail!</td>', 'very cool!  i love all the different textures!...and that little rainbow reflection in the top  of the sculpture...great detail!', '2003-08-06 22:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(379444, 32211, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful abstract... I love the way the light and shadows play together in this image.  I also appreciate your choice to include the diagonal element in this photo.  Excellent work... = 10</td>', 'This is a beautiful abstract... I love the way the light and shadows play together in this image.  I also appreciate your choice to include the diagonal element in this photo.  Excellent work... = 10', '2003-08-06 22:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(379446, 31823, 772, '<td valign="top">This is simply beautiful.  Your composition on this one is perfect with the placement of the setting sun.   These crosses are also beautiful... I think this is my favorite of all the photos in this challenge... kudos :) = 10</td>', 'This is simply beautiful.  Your composition on this one is perfect with the placement of the setting sun.   These crosses are also beautiful... I think this is my favorite of all the photos in this challenge... kudos :) = 10', '2003-08-06 22:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
