(379948, 32149, 10084, '<td valign="top">Don''t like that you included the floor in the composition. Your eyes are lead from the top of the picture to the bottom. The top is B&amp;W and the bottom is not completely B&amp;W. Maybe with the current composition if the floor was change to completley B&amp;W it would look nicer or cropped before the floor started.</td>', 'Don''t like that you included the floor in the composition. Your eyes are lead from the top of the picture to the bottom. The top is B&W and the bottom is not completely B&W. Maybe with the current composition if the floor was change to completley B&W it would look nicer or cropped before the floor started.', '2003-08-07 05:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(379950, 32066, 8643, '<td valign="top">A larger version without the frame might do better.</td>', 'A larger version without the frame might do better.', '2003-08-07 05:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(379951, 31977, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot. It leads your eyes toward the center or ladder of the picture, then he yellow of the columns bring your eyes to the left and you automatically scan the right of the picture and see a bike. Composition is very nice.</td>', 'I like this image a lot. It leads your eyes toward the center or ladder of the picture, then he yellow of the columns bring your eyes to the left and you automatically scan the right of the picture and see a bike. Composition is very nice.', '2003-08-07 05:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(379952, 32167, 9462, '<td valign="top">Finally! Some relief from voting all these boring pix... thank you :)</td>', 'Finally! Some relief from voting all these boring pix... thank you :)', '2003-08-07 05:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(379956, 32240, 10084, '<td valign="top">Glad you did this picture in B&amp;W. Love the shadows on the wall. Composition reminds me of that artist that paints those geometric paintings. Kind of like the L''oreal logo. Don''t remember his name.</td>', 'Glad you did this picture in B&W. Love the shadows on the wall. Composition reminds me of that artist that paints those geometric paintings. Kind of like the L''oreal logo. Don''t remember his name.', '2003-08-07 05:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(379961, 31996, 10084, '<td valign="top">Wish this picture had more contrast.More lightness and darkness would have been good. Composition is very nice.</td>', 'Wish this picture had more contrast.More lightness and darkness would have been good. Composition is very nice.', '2003-08-07 05:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(379965, 32203, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is stunning!  Well spotted and beautiful execution. - 10!</td>', 'This is stunning!  Well spotted and beautiful execution. - 10!', '2003-08-07 06:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(379967, 31651, 8643, '<td valign="top">Great idea - love the hidden depths - and the angles - 10</td>', 'Great idea - love the hidden depths - and the angles - 10', '2003-08-07 06:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(379968, 31957, 10084, '<td valign="top">I wished this photo was a bit sharper or focused in front. It would make it look more 3dish and stand out. I''m glad this image isn''t in B&amp;W, it would be difficult to see the wires in the back. Composition is very good.</td>', 'I wished this photo was a bit sharper or focused in front. It would make it look more 3dish and stand out. I''m glad this image isn''t in B&W, it would be difficult to see the wires in the back. Composition is very good.', '2003-08-07 06:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(379969, 32029, 8643, '<td valign="top">Clever and eye catching.</td>', 'Clever and eye catching.', '2003-08-07 06:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(379972, 32232, 4258, '<td valign="top">Good lighting - but the pole looks forced upon just to meet the challenge</td>', 'Good lighting - but the pole looks forced upon just to meet the challenge', '2003-08-07 06:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(379973, 32211, 4258, '<td valign="top">WOW! This is real good, its almost like one of those optical illusion book, good interpretation of the challenge - The right angles really make the strength of the photograph</td>', 'WOW! This is real good, its almost like one of those optical illusion book, good interpretation of the challenge - The right angles really make the strength of the photograph', '2003-08-07 06:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(379975, 31309, 4258, '<td valign="top">too abstract for my liking</td>', 'too abstract for my liking', '2003-08-07 06:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(379976, 31265, 5333, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot. 7</td>', 'Nice clean shot. 7', '2003-08-07 06:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(379977, 31615, 5333, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge very well! The ''window'' does a good job in fixing the viewer''s eyes towards the model. 10</td>', 'Fits the challenge very well! The ''window'' does a good job in fixing the viewer''s eyes towards the model. 10', '2003-08-07 06:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
