(379982, 31894, 10084, '<td valign="top">Love the title. Great composition. I like how you have the One Way sign in the center of the photo. We all know that a city has a lot of towering buildings. The sign is just pointing towards some of them. Reflections on glass of other buildings always look nice.Only thing I don''t like is the cut off light pole.</td>', 'Love the title. Great composition. I like how you have the One Way sign in the center of the photo. We all know that a city has a lot of towering buildings. The sign is just pointing towards some of them. Reflections on glass of other buildings always look nice.Only thing I don''t like is the cut off light pole.', '2003-08-07 06:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(379983, 31939, 4258, '<td valign="top">lack of clear  focus point and a shallow depth mars this picture</td>', 'lack of clear  focus point and a shallow depth mars this picture', '2003-08-07 06:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(379984, 32191, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice shot angle. Nice contrast. Everything leads you to the top of the pole, including the clouds with the blue right inbetween the pole. Beautiful</td>', 'Nice shot angle. Nice contrast. Everything leads you to the top of the pole, including the clouds with the blue right inbetween the pole. Beautiful', '2003-08-07 06:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(379985, 32075, 4258, '<td valign="top">only if you had not chopped the corner in the bottom most rung [7]</td>', 'only if you had not chopped the corner in the bottom most rung [7]', '2003-08-07 06:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(379986, 32252, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. I would have like to see more contrast. The shadows are nice. Maybe if the image was in B&amp;W. Pretty cool image</td>', 'Interesting composition. I would have like to see more contrast. The shadows are nice. Maybe if the image was in B&W. Pretty cool image', '2003-08-07 06:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(379987, 32207, 4258, '<td valign="top">nice - would have prefered atleast one more object in the frame, if not anything the reflection of the lamp itself</td>', 'nice - would have prefered atleast one more object in the frame, if not anything the reflection of the lamp itself', '2003-08-07 06:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(379988, 32036, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Sunset/Sunrise. Needs more contrast. Can''t see the right angles very well. Your eyes are automatically focused on the sun so I don''t know if it would make a difference. It would be nice to see a soluette of the patio. The column in the middle move over further to the right.</td>', 'Beautiful Sunset/Sunrise. Needs more contrast. Can''t see the right angles very well. Your eyes are automatically focused on the sun so I don''t know if it would make a difference. It would be nice to see a soluette of the patio. The column in the middle move over further to the right.', '2003-08-07 06:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(379989, 31274, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition nice. Nice timing (No pun intended)for the right angles. Needs a little bit more contrast to much gray. I think it would be nice if the face was white.</td>', 'Composition nice. Nice timing (No pun intended)for the right angles. Needs a little bit more contrast to much gray. I think it would be nice if the face was white.', '2003-08-07 06:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(379990, 31402, 10084, '<td valign="top">Compositon is good. You automatically look into the cats eyes because of the perspective. Needs to be focused just a little bit but none the less great picture.</td>', 'Compositon is good. You automatically look into the cats eyes because of the perspective. Needs to be focused just a little bit but none the less great picture.', '2003-08-07 06:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(379993, 32218, 10084, '<td valign="top">Whats up with the colors. Actually might look really good if you convert this image into a B&amp;W image. Fix the contrast a little. Love the composition.</td>', 'Whats up with the colors. Actually might look really good if you convert this image into a B&W image. Fix the contrast a little. Love the composition.', '2003-08-07 06:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(379995, 31405, 10084, '<td valign="top">Cool composition. Need to play with focusing a little. Kind of grainy. Might want to try converting into B&amp;W image.</td>', 'Cool composition. Need to play with focusing a little. Kind of grainy. Might want to try converting into B&W image.', '2003-08-07 06:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(379999, 31641, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup. Composition is very nice. A little blurry. Maybe convert into a B&amp;W image.</td>', 'Nice closeup. Composition is very nice. A little blurry. Maybe convert into a B&W image.', '2003-08-07 06:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(380008, 32225, 10084, '<td valign="top">The image is nice, but I don''t like the composition. Picture seems busy at the bottom. Maybe if the circular image was closer to the center. Love the color in there. The focus is perfect.</td>', 'The image is nice, but I don''t like the composition. Picture seems busy at the bottom. Maybe if the circular image was closer to the center. Love the color in there. The focus is perfect.', '2003-08-07 06:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
