(380021, 32010, 4258, '<td valign="top">This could have been a marvelous picture. Better light, get complete of her right leg into the composition, may be get one of her arms to make a right angle as well. Currently it does not appeal to me  - [5]</td>', 'This could have been a marvelous picture. Better light, get complete of her right leg into the composition, may be get one of her arms to make a right angle as well. Currently it does not appeal to me  - [5]', '2003-08-07 07:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
