(380026, 32035, 4258, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, meets the challenge, sepia tones and grains work here, however dark color shorts on the model JUST don''t fit into the composition [8]</td>', 'Good lighting, meets the challenge, sepia tones and grains work here, however dark color shorts on the model JUST don''t fit into the composition [8]', '2003-08-07 07:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(380027, 31399, 4258, '<td valign="top">Could you have avoided the reflections in the window panes?</td>', 'Could you have avoided the reflections in the window panes?', '2003-08-07 07:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(380031, 31650, 10084, '<td valign="top">Whimsical and fun picture. I like the corners, wished you pulled back a little and shown more of corners. I think it would have been a nicer composition.</td>', 'Whimsical and fun picture. I like the corners, wished you pulled back a little and shown more of corners. I think it would have been a nicer composition.', '2003-08-07 07:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(380036, 32136, 10084, '<td valign="top">Bright sunlight. Don''t shoot into sunlight. I will ruin your eyes and your camera lense. Your idea would have been nice if done correctly. The reflection of the sun killed this picture. Good composition idea though.</td>', 'Bright sunlight. Don''t shoot into sunlight. I will ruin your eyes and your camera lense. Your idea would have been nice if done correctly. The reflection of the sun killed this picture. Good composition idea though.', '2003-08-07 07:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(380038, 31849, 9885, '<td valign="top">where are the right angles?</td>', 'where are the right angles?', '2003-08-07 07:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(380039, 32218, 9885, '<td valign="top">great subject and taken at a good angle. However, I find the background vegetation poking above the fence too distracting. Also, if you could adjust the levels to make the white of the fence even more distinct, then I think you''d have a really great shot.</td>', 'great subject and taken at a good angle. However, I find the background vegetation poking above the fence too distracting. Also, if you could adjust the levels to make the white of the fence even more distinct, then I think you''d have a really great shot.', '2003-08-07 07:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(380055, 32034, 4258, '<td valign="top">I dont think the cat is puzzled - it is just cleaning - cats are too smart ;)</td>', 'I dont think the cat is puzzled - it is just cleaning - cats are too smart ;)', '2003-08-07 07:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
