(380442, 32196, 3087, '<td valign="top">Rich colour and light and I like the DOF choice. Nice choice of angle too.</td>', 'Rich colour and light and I like the DOF choice. Nice choice of angle too.', '2003-08-07 11:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(380443, 31399, 9703, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and contrasts.</td>', 'Nice colors and contrasts.', '2003-08-07 11:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(380445, 31594, 9703, '<td valign="top">cute photo! Very different subject matter. Creative!</td>', 'cute photo! Very different subject matter. Creative!', '2003-08-07 11:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(380447, 32054, 3087, '<td valign="top">Quirky and manages to combine abstract with non-abstract. Nice choice - well conceived.</td>', 'Quirky and manages to combine abstract with non-abstract. Nice choice - well conceived.', '2003-08-07 11:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(380448, 31816, 9703, '<td valign="top">nice tones, texture and detail.</td>', 'nice tones, texture and detail.', '2003-08-07 11:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(380449, 32244, 9703, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, good eye!</td>', 'Nice capture, good eye!', '2003-08-07 11:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(380450, 31784, 10643, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this to up my rating. This is definitely in my top 3 for this challenge. AND I''m going to look for these books, as the whole series looks really interesting. I love the way they look like they''re in the midst of toppling off a table. A clever angle to achieve that effect.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this to up my rating. This is definitely in my top 3 for this challenge. AND I''m going to look for these books, as the whole series looks really interesting. I love the way they look like they''re in the midst of toppling off a table. A clever angle to achieve that effect.', '2003-08-07 11:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(380454, 32029, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve had comments by now on the "right angle" aspect so I''ll restrict myself only to the image strength - good colours, nice use of light and shadow to create a mood in something so abstract, great composition.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve had comments by now on the "right angle" aspect so I''ll restrict myself only to the image strength - good colours, nice use of light and shadow to create a mood in something so abstract, great composition.', '2003-08-07 11:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(380456, 31814, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think with only a single fruit this would be a stronger image and I''d prefer it if it were not cropped to square but continued out on right side. Nice texture and colours and choice of content.</td>', 'I think with only a single fruit this would be a stronger image and I''d prefer it if it were not cropped to square but continued out on right side. Nice texture and colours and choice of content.', '2003-08-07 11:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(380458, 31553, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures, excellent viewpoint and perspective, I like the dark moody feel conveyed by the lighting - is it slightly desaturated too?<br/>Nice shot!</td>', 'Beautiful textures, excellent viewpoint and perspective, I like the dark moody feel conveyed by the lighting - is it slightly desaturated too?Nice shot!', '2003-08-07 11:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(380461, 31665, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this interpretation and the contrast between curves and angles - even the angles are softened ones yet clearly discernible. Excellent viewpoint and composition and I love the close crop and choice of high grain. Lighting is perhaps a touch harsh though I like the dark shadows which balance the bright highlights.</td>', 'I really like this interpretation and the contrast between curves and angles - even the angles are softened ones yet clearly discernible. Excellent viewpoint and composition and I love the close crop and choice of high grain. Lighting is perhaps a touch harsh though I like the dark shadows which balance the bright highlights.', '2003-08-07 11:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(380462, 32241, 10643, '<td valign="top">the reflection of the sky is fantastic. I can hardly tell if this is the side of a building or a paved plaza, but I just want to reach out and touch it either way.</td>', 'the reflection of the sky is fantastic. I can hardly tell if this is the side of a building or a paved plaza, but I just want to reach out and touch it either way.', '2003-08-07 11:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(380465, 32073, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great content and composition and very quirky idea. Though I like the edge of darkness in the clouds I think this is let down by lighting - there just isn''t enough light on the tree and foliage for my liking and a little more natural light would bring out the zingy yellows too. Nice image though and an unusual and creative challenge interpretation.</td>', 'Great content and composition and very quirky idea. Though I like the edge of darkness in the clouds I think this is let down by lighting - there just isn''t enough light on the tree and foliage for my liking and a little more natural light would bring out the zingy yellows too. Nice image though and an unusual and creative challenge interpretation.', '2003-08-07 11:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(380466, 31773, 10643, '<td valign="top">a photo completely free of right angles...?</td>', 'a photo completely free of right angles...?', '2003-08-07 11:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(380470, 31860, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love it! Strong image, rather abstract, works well in b/w. Good composition with the curved "hill" shape along the top.</td>', 'Love it! Strong image, rather abstract, works well in b/w. Good composition with the curved "hill" shape along the top.', '2003-08-07 11:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(380472, 32037, 10643, '<td valign="top">the bird passing over is a very nice touch. hope you didn''t have to wait too long for him to happen by!</td>', 'the bird passing over is a very nice touch. hope you didn''t have to wait too long for him to happen by!', '2003-08-07 11:55:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(380473, 32048, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, great idea, strong colours and light, not sure on composition - the position of the forks in the frame doesn''t feel quite right to me.</td>', 'Beautiful image, great idea, strong colours and light, not sure on composition - the position of the forks in the frame doesn''t feel quite right to me.', '2003-08-07 11:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(380477, 31983, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a textured surface - I like it a lot. Good composition with non perforated area to left, diagonal line just left of centre and perforated pattern to right. The colours are also great.</td>', 'Wow - what a textured surface - I like it a lot. Good composition with non perforated area to left, diagonal line just left of centre and perforated pattern to right. The colours are also great.', '2003-08-07 11:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(380479, 32211, 3087, '<td valign="top">Clever furniture abstract - lighting seems a little too yellow - composition is fun.</td>', 'Clever furniture abstract - lighting seems a little too yellow - composition is fun.', '2003-08-07 11:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(380482, 31994, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent crop, wonderful symmetry and asymmetry both in colours/ content and in light/ dark.</td>', 'Excellent crop, wonderful symmetry and asymmetry both in colours/ content and in light/ dark.', '2003-08-07 11:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(380484, 31882, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely. I like the quality of light and the way it catches the web. I''d like a touch more of the walkway flooring but I like this a lot as it is - it leads me to wonder what''s down the walkway - ie it pulls me in.</td>', 'Lovely. I like the quality of light and the way it catches the web. I''d like a touch more of the walkway flooring but I like this a lot as it is - it leads me to wonder what''s down the walkway - ie it pulls me in.', '2003-08-07 12:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(380486, 32238, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great content. Composition fairly good though I think they are a little too close to left edge and much too close to bottom egde. Lighting is too harsh for my tastes though it does give it a slightly ethereal feel.</td>', 'Great content. Composition fairly good though I think they are a little too close to left edge and much too close to bottom egde. Lighting is too harsh for my tastes though it does give it a slightly ethereal feel.', '2003-08-07 12:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(380488, 31570, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this and would probably buy it as a postcard in an art shop. Just great colour and composition and I love the combination of bright and chirpy with gritty and mundane. The angle of the road really strengthens the impact of the squares and rectangles.</td>', 'I really like this and would probably buy it as a postcard in an art shop. Just great colour and composition and I love the combination of bright and chirpy with gritty and mundane. The angle of the road really strengthens the impact of the squares and rectangles.', '2003-08-07 12:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(380490, 32230, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great idea for content but actual image is rather drab - I''d suggest thinking of shooting from different angles and different heights, playing with light and shadow options and also looking at different backgrounds.</td>', 'Great idea for content but actual image is rather drab - I''d suggest thinking of shooting from different angles and different heights, playing with light and shadow options and also looking at different backgrounds.', '2003-08-07 12:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(380492, 32204, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice example of this idea - clean, good diagonals, nice composition and strong colours.</td>', 'Nice example of this idea - clean, good diagonals, nice composition and strong colours.', '2003-08-07 12:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(380494, 31601, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF and b/w treatment. Nice angles and lovely subtle lighting. A really nice image.</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF and b/w treatment. Nice angles and lovely subtle lighting. A really nice image.', '2003-08-07 12:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(380495, 31957, 3087, '<td valign="top">Though I think it needs a focal point I do like the texture, the colours of sky, metal and rust and the busy repetition of pattern.</td>', 'Though I think it needs a focal point I do like the texture, the colours of sky, metal and rust and the busy repetition of pattern.', '2003-08-07 12:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(380496, 32135, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh I like this. What a strange and enigmatic picture! Even the actual feet have character of their own. Quirky and interesting!</td>', 'Oooh I like this. What a strange and enigmatic picture! Even the actual feet have character of their own. Quirky and interesting!', '2003-08-07 12:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(380509, 31666, 9768, '<td valign="top">I did my due 10 :-)</td>', 'I did my due 10 :-)', '2003-08-07 12:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(380514, 31665, 9768, '<td valign="top">I did my due 10:-)</td>', 'I did my due 10:-)', '2003-08-07 12:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(380538, 32138, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and I like the shallow DOF. Also like the b/w choice. Composition is interesting but just too centred for my preferences.</td>', 'Nice idea and I like the shallow DOF. Also like the b/w choice. Composition is interesting but just too centred for my preferences.', '2003-08-07 12:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(380539, 31956, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, Boring subject</td>', 'Nicely framed, Boring subject', '2003-08-07 12:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(380541, 31796, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lots of nice RAs and the close crop is a good idea in terms of making this a little more abstract and in strengthening composition. I like the diagonal from top right to lower left. That said the content just doesn''t excite me visually very much.</td>', 'Lots of nice RAs and the close crop is a good idea in terms of making this a little more abstract and in strengthening composition. I like the diagonal from top right to lower left. That said the content just doesn''t excite me visually very much.', '2003-08-07 12:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(380544, 31886, 9027, '<td valign="top">i like the subtle colors in this. the inclusion of people adds interest, cute</td>', 'i like the subtle colors in this. the inclusion of people adds interest, cute', '2003-08-07 12:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(380545, 31384, 10888, '<td valign="top">Very interesting angle. Nice right angles and I really like the texture of the subject.</td>', 'Very interesting angle. Nice right angles and I really like the texture of the subject.', '2003-08-07 12:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(380546, 32193, 9027, '<td valign="top">the extreme blur of the buildings are a little strange (hurts my eyes a bit since they take up such a big part of the pic), but i like how they frame the spider.</td>', 'the extreme blur of the buildings are a little strange (hurts my eyes a bit since they take up such a big part of the pic), but i like how they frame the spider.', '2003-08-07 12:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(380547, 31927, 10888, '<td valign="top">Good color in the bricks.</td>', 'Good color in the bricks.', '2003-08-07 12:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(380548, 31480, 9027, '<td valign="top">not fond of the worn out treatment, but very nice idea and good composition.</td>', 'not fond of the worn out treatment, but very nice idea and good composition.', '2003-08-07 12:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(380549, 32075, 9027, '<td valign="top">great abstract. love the colors! works with out the heavy border.</td>', 'great abstract. love the colors! works with out the heavy border.', '2003-08-07 12:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(380552, 32144, 9027, '<td valign="top">exposure is washed out. could use better focus and contrast. another possibility is to crop out all the landscape and just have the top of the bridge, perhaps stronger.</td>', 'exposure is washed out. could use better focus and contrast. another possibility is to crop out all the landscape and just have the top of the bridge, perhaps stronger.', '2003-08-07 12:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(380554, 32203, 10888, '<td valign="top">Wow! Nice leading lines and the color is wonderful! Some good right angles also. This is one of the better photos that I''ve seen for right angels. Good Job!</td>', 'Wow! Nice leading lines and the color is wonderful! Some good right angles also. This is one of the better photos that I''ve seen for right angels. Good Job!', '2003-08-07 12:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(380555, 32054, 10888, '<td valign="top">I really like the repeating blocks and windows!</td>', 'I really like the repeating blocks and windows!', '2003-08-07 12:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(380558, 32191, 10888, '<td valign="top">Good angles! Also have some good cloads.</td>', 'Good angles! Also have some good cloads.', '2003-08-07 13:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(380559, 32174, 9027, '<td valign="top">the sun is really harsh, but i kind of like the effect. gives the image a magical feeling.</td>', 'the sun is really harsh, but i kind of like the effect. gives the image a magical feeling.', '2003-08-07 13:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(380560, 31615, 10888, '<td valign="top">I really be interested to see this photo balck &amp; white. I think it wood set more of a mood. Good right angles and nice touch with the subjest sitting in the window! You really could have some nice contrast in this shot!</td>', 'I really be interested to see this photo balck & white. I think it wood set more of a mood. Good right angles and nice touch with the subjest sitting in the window! You really could have some nice contrast in this shot!', '2003-08-07 13:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(380561, 31651, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice! love the dramatic lighting.</td>', 'nice! love the dramatic lighting.', '2003-08-07 13:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(380562, 31963, 9886, '<td valign="top">NIce idea, although I find the window just a hint too small. The green grass is also slightly distracting, perhaps if you just got a bit lower down for the shot? Still, it''s original and I like it :)</td>', 'NIce idea, although I find the window just a hint too small. The green grass is also slightly distracting, perhaps if you just got a bit lower down for the shot? Still, it''s original and I like it :)', '2003-08-07 13:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(380564, 31788, 10888, '<td valign="top">Great contrast! I really like your subject. Overall a really nice photo!</td>', 'Great contrast! I really like your subject. Overall a really nice photo!', '2003-08-07 13:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(380566, 31293, 9886, '<td valign="top">As much as I am a sucker for dogs, I don''t feel that right angles produce the strength of the image here.</td>', 'As much as I am a sucker for dogs, I don''t feel that right angles produce the strength of the image here.', '2003-08-07 13:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(380569, 31624, 9027, '<td valign="top">the contrast between the sign and person really gives a sense of how far away the castle is. my favorite thing about this is the little person on the bottom. hehe :o)</td>', 'the contrast between the sign and person really gives a sense of how far away the castle is. my favorite thing about this is the little person on the bottom. hehe :o)', '2003-08-07 13:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(380573, 31806, 10888, '<td valign="top">Good right angle. The only thing I might have done different is time of day photo was taken. Try early morning or evening. Better light! Overall a nice shot.</td>', 'Good right angle. The only thing I might have done different is time of day photo was taken. Try early morning or evening. Better light! Overall a nice shot.', '2003-08-07 13:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(380578, 32057, 10888, '<td valign="top">Good leading lines. You have good angles but I think more contrast would have really brought out the photo. Overall good shot!</td>', 'Good leading lines. You have good angles but I think more contrast would have really brought out the photo. Overall good shot!', '2003-08-07 13:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(380585, 31860, 10888, '<td valign="top">The longer I look at this photo the more I really like it! I think its kinda funny! Could use a bit more contrast but overall a great shot. Good leading lines to the sprinkler heads.</td>', 'The longer I look at this photo the more I really like it! I think its kinda funny! Could use a bit more contrast but overall a great shot. Good leading lines to the sprinkler heads.', '2003-08-07 13:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(380589, 32145, 9027, '<td valign="top">i didn''t know there was a science in the right way of cutting cheese! hehe.</td>', 'i didn''t know there was a science in the right way of cutting cheese! hehe.', '2003-08-07 13:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(380592, 31765, 10888, '<td valign="top">Good right angles but could use more contrast!</td>', 'Good right angles but could use more contrast!', '2003-08-07 13:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(380594, 32073, 4258, '<td valign="top">More than freak this appears to have been struck by lightening - Nice picture</td>', 'More than freak this appears to have been struck by lightening - Nice picture', '2003-08-07 13:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(380595, 32065, 4500, '<td valign="top">the quality of the image is so low that I cannot recognize the subject in foreground</td>', 'the quality of the image is so low that I cannot recognize the subject in foreground', '2003-08-07 13:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(380597, 32029, 9886, '<td valign="top">Ooh, sexy. The green is slightly wonky ... but we''ll forget about that :)</td>', 'Ooh, sexy. The green is slightly wonky ... but we''ll forget about that :)', '2003-08-07 13:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(380599, 32227, 4500, '<td valign="top">it''s too much saturated</td>', 'it''s too much saturated', '2003-08-07 13:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(380600, 32057, 9027, '<td valign="top">i think this would be stronger with more contrast. everything seems to be in the midtone range and blends together.</td>', 'i think this would be stronger with more contrast. everything seems to be in the midtone range and blends together.', '2003-08-07 13:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(380601, 31965, 10888, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo! A bit more contrast would have been better but overall  a nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting photo! A bit more contrast would have been better but overall  a nice shot.', '2003-08-07 13:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(380602, 32176, 9027, '<td valign="top">very nice sculpture. i think this pic could have worked with just that. :o)</td>', 'very nice sculpture. i think this pic could have worked with just that. :o)', '2003-08-07 13:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(380604, 31770, 4500, '<td valign="top">why so unsharp and with the reflections? is it behind a glass?</td>', 'why so unsharp and with the reflections? is it behind a glass?', '2003-08-07 13:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(380606, 31661, 9027, '<td valign="top">good closeup. i like how you were able to catch the texture in the pages.</td>', 'good closeup. i like how you were able to catch the texture in the pages.', '2003-08-07 13:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(380607, 31823, 10888, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo! The color is wonderful. Overall a really nice silouette!</td>', 'Lovely photo! The color is wonderful. Overall a really nice silouette!', '2003-08-07 13:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(380608, 31756, 4500, '<td valign="top">woow this is cool, makes me sick when I look in the middle, good efect</td>', 'woow this is cool, makes me sick when I look in the middle, good efect', '2003-08-07 13:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(380609, 32211, 4500, '<td valign="top">perfect lines and angles, perfect light, perfect color, good job</td>', 'perfect lines and angles, perfect light, perfect color, good job', '2003-08-07 13:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(380610, 31951, 9027, '<td valign="top">i like this. could use just a touch of contrast to bring more definition, but otherwise, good idea.</td>', 'i like this. could use just a touch of contrast to bring more definition, but otherwise, good idea.', '2003-08-07 13:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(380613, 31802, 10888, '<td valign="top">Great angles. Could use more contrast.</td>', 'Great angles. Could use more contrast.', '2003-08-07 13:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(380617, 31514, 4258, '<td valign="top">Next time please remove noise</td>', 'Next time please remove noise', '2003-08-07 13:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(380618, 31608, 9027, '<td valign="top">idea is good, but background is distracting and another method of lighting, softer/more subtle,  would have made this stronger. currently just looks like a snapshot.</td>', 'idea is good, but background is distracting and another method of lighting, softer/more subtle,  would have made this stronger. currently just looks like a snapshot.', '2003-08-07 13:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(380620, 32035, 4500, '<td valign="top">Wonderful Study of Body and Lines ;) You did a very good job, in this case I don''t care too much about finding some right angles, the picture works with or without them very well.</td>', 'Wonderful Study of Body and Lines ;) You did a very good job, in this case I don''t care too much about finding some right angles, the picture works with or without them very well.', '2003-08-07 13:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(380622, 32255, 10888, '<td valign="top">Nice angles. More contrast would have been nice.</td>', 'Nice angles. More contrast would have been nice.', '2003-08-07 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(380625, 31952, 4500, '<td valign="top">a bit unusual angle of the subject, but it works. Good job</td>', 'a bit unusual angle of the subject, but it works. Good job', '2003-08-07 13:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(380626, 31426, 9027, '<td valign="top">a little washed out. could use more contrast and saturation to strengthen image.</td>', 'a little washed out. could use more contrast and saturation to strengthen image.', '2003-08-07 13:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(380628, 31651, 4500, '<td valign="top">The light is just perfect, good job</td>', 'The light is just perfect, good job', '2003-08-07 13:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(380629, 32033, 9027, '<td valign="top">interesting composition, but wish the brick was in focus!</td>', 'interesting composition, but wish the brick was in focus!', '2003-08-07 13:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(380631, 31983, 4500, '<td valign="top">nice shot, the texture is cool</td>', 'nice shot, the texture is cool', '2003-08-07 13:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(380633, 31553, 4500, '<td valign="top">perfect texture and wonderful lightning, wow</td>', 'perfect texture and wonderful lightning, wow', '2003-08-07 13:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(380634, 32062, 10888, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines. Would have been interesting to see this photo as a black &amp; white. I think the contrast would be nice.</td>', 'Nice leading lines. Would have been interesting to see this photo as a black & white. I think the contrast would be nice.', '2003-08-07 13:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
