(380643, 32037, 9027, '<td valign="top">it looks like she''s grimacing because she sees the bird coming over, afraid she''ll be a bulls eye. i like the humor in this, but a bit overly bright.</td>', 'it looks like she''s grimacing because she sees the bird coming over, afraid she''ll be a bulls eye. i like the humor in this, but a bit overly bright.', '2003-08-07 13:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
