(381263, 32054, 5767, '<td valign="top">Great use of repeatitive patterns.  You''ve composed them very well with great attention to their alignment and border proximity (which is so important in images like this).  Well done.</td>', 'Great use of repeatitive patterns.  You''ve composed them very well with great attention to their alignment and border proximity (which is so important in images like this).  Well done.', '2003-08-07 21:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
