(381363, 32248, 8891, '<td valign="top">sometimes you need to wait....and sometimes you need to have been there sooner. The sun is underused in this, in needs to have more clout in the shot or not be there at all.  From a pure abstract point of view, I would prefer it not there at all as the silver, gray and blue color combo would be fine without it.  But You need to have the top left of the building in the frame.  It would greatly improve the composition.</td>', 'sometimes you need to wait....and sometimes you need to have been there sooner. The sun is underused in this, in needs to have more clout in the shot or not be there at all.  From a pure abstract point of view, I would prefer it not there at all as the silver, gray and blue color combo would be fine without it.  But You need to have the top left of the building in the frame.  It would greatly improve the composition.', '2003-08-07 22:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(381364, 32018, 8891, '<td valign="top">needs a rotation CW a bit.</td>', 'needs a rotation CW a bit.', '2003-08-07 22:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
