(381486, 31818, 10402, '<td valign="top">I suppose it is close enough to a right angle. But it isn''t very interesting. It would perhaps portray the intended subject better if the background was more suggestive of a courtroom than a living room (preferably showing a bench with a gavel, but at least wood paneling). And the attached hand should really be included.</td>', 'I suppose it is close enough to a right angle. But it isn''t very interesting. It would perhaps portray the intended subject better if the background was more suggestive of a courtroom than a living room (preferably showing a bench with a gavel, but at least wood paneling). And the attached hand should really be included.', '2003-08-08 01:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
