(381565, 31912, 6870, '<td valign="top">Get a shirt on this girl. Who do you think you are--dr. JOnes? Just kidding. Cute gal. The right angle of the triangle is not as clearly apparent as it could be, but what a great idea to put in the random background of leaves and child.</td>', 'Get a shirt on this girl. Who do you think you are--dr. JOnes? Just kidding. Cute gal. The right angle of the triangle is not as clearly apparent as it could be, but what a great idea to put in the random background of leaves and child.', '2003-08-08 02:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(381566, 31945, 10084, '<td valign="top">Picture is underexposed. Not enough light hitting the lense. Reason is overcast skies. Try taking out of Auto exposure and boost the ISO or Exposure rating on your camera . Better with a tripod or if you can''t afford (like me), brace up against something sturdy like a wall. The way the compostion is that the buildings lead your eyes upwards and you don''t really look at the Empire State Building. Try cropping lower or take a picture closer to the ESB if you really want to include it.</td>', 'Picture is underexposed. Not enough light hitting the lense. Reason is overcast skies. Try taking out of Auto exposure and boost the ISO or Exposure rating on your camera . Better with a tripod or if you can''t afford (like me), brace up against something sturdy like a wall. The way the compostion is that the buildings lead your eyes upwards and you don''t really look at the Empire State Building. Try cropping lower or take a picture closer to the ESB if you really want to include it.', '2003-08-08 02:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
