(381569, 31942, 10084, '<td valign="top">Overexposed. Too much light going into your camera. Tone down on ISO, exposure rating, or outdoor mode. I wished that the composition was straighter. I like the dark column near the right side adds a little depth.</td>', 'Overexposed. Too much light going into your camera. Tone down on ISO, exposure rating, or outdoor mode. I wished that the composition was straighter. I like the dark column near the right side adds a little depth.', '2003-08-08 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(381571, 31297, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice angle. love the composition and the feet, so funny!</td>', 'nice angle. love the composition and the feet, so funny!', '2003-08-08 02:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(381572, 32200, 10084, '<td valign="top">Most people would take the picture of the building in the middle of the photo, but I like the composition that you made. Pattern looks beautiful. Might want to play with the picture in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Most people would take the picture of the building in the middle of the photo, but I like the composition that you made. Pattern looks beautiful. Might want to play with the picture in b&w.', '2003-08-08 02:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(381575, 31952, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice set up, good focus.</td>', 'nice set up, good focus.', '2003-08-08 02:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(381576, 32195, 10084, '<td valign="top">Colors need to be balanced, too much reds. Was color balance set to auto? If it was try playing around with the manual. My camera will do the same in certain lighting conditions. Compositions is nice. Try playing with photo in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Colors need to be balanced, too much reds. Was color balance set to auto? If it was try playing around with the manual. My camera will do the same in certain lighting conditions. Compositions is nice. Try playing with photo in b&w.', '2003-08-08 02:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(381578, 31628, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is very good.  Building tiny bit underexposed (bit dark). Tough to get a good shot in bright sunlight.</td>', 'Composition is very good.  Building tiny bit underexposed (bit dark). Tough to get a good shot in bright sunlight.', '2003-08-08 02:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(381581, 31315, 5767, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  I really enjoyed the colors and subject.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  I really enjoyed the colors and subject.', '2003-08-08 02:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(381583, 31864, 10084, '<td valign="top">A lot of noise (All the little colors in the dark areas) Did you use a high ISO setting or Auto? If Auto, it might be better to set it lower in manual mode. Composition is nice.  You may want to play with this picture in b&amp;w.</td>', 'A lot of noise (All the little colors in the dark areas) Did you use a high ISO setting or Auto? If Auto, it might be better to set it lower in manual mode. Composition is nice.  You may want to play with this picture in b&w.', '2003-08-08 02:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(381585, 31645, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Love the reflections. Buildings look like they''re going to tip over. The composition is good.</td>', 'Great picture. Love the reflections. Buildings look like they''re going to tip over. The composition is good.', '2003-08-08 02:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(381587, 32072, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice compostion. Did you use a starburst lens? Think this would look good as a panaramic shot.</td>', 'Nice compostion. Did you use a starburst lens? Think this would look good as a panaramic shot.', '2003-08-08 02:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(381588, 32135, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Looks good in b&amp;w</td>', 'Nice composition. Looks good in b&w', '2003-08-08 03:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(381591, 31886, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I feel like I''m there. Shadows are very nice.</td>', 'Great composition. I feel like I''m there. Shadows are very nice.', '2003-08-08 03:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(381593, 32214, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. Wonder what it would look like in b&amp;w. Composition is great.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. Wonder what it would look like in b&w. Composition is great.', '2003-08-08 03:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(381594, 32018, 10084, '<td valign="top">A great postcard shot. Focus is very nice. Good composition. Might look really good in b&amp;w too.</td>', 'A great postcard shot. Focus is very nice. Good composition. Might look really good in b&w too.', '2003-08-08 03:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(381597, 32143, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Picture seems to have some noise. Too high of an ISO. If it was set on Auto bring down or set it on Indoor mode. This should make it so that the wall would look more natural and you can feel the rough surface.</td>', 'Good composition. Picture seems to have some noise. Too high of an ISO. If it was set on Auto bring down or set it on Indoor mode. This should make it so that the wall would look more natural and you can feel the rough surface.', '2003-08-08 03:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(381598, 31892, 10084, '<td valign="top">Overexposed makes the picture  too bright. Was the exposure set on outdoor mode? If it was, maybe put it on manual and set it a little lower. Composition is very good.</td>', 'Overexposed makes the picture  too bright. Was the exposure set on outdoor mode? If it was, maybe put it on manual and set it a little lower. Composition is very good.', '2003-08-08 03:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(381599, 32193, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like that you focused in on the spider and not use a flash. It shows the form of the spider. Beautiful. I can just picture the New York landscape with the spider and the Spiderman 2 title coming out. Great composition.</td>', 'I like that you focused in on the spider and not use a flash. It shows the form of the spider. Beautiful. I can just picture the New York landscape with the spider and the Spiderman 2 title coming out. Great composition.', '2003-08-08 03:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(381600, 31627, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I like that you used b&amp;w. Contrast is very good.</td>', 'Great composition. I like that you used b&w. Contrast is very good.', '2003-08-08 03:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(381601, 31810, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good silhouete. Composition is nice. Very moody.</td>', 'Good silhouete. Composition is nice. Very moody.', '2003-08-08 03:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(381602, 32163, 7938, '<td valign="top">great image but where are the right angles that are given power to your image?</td>', 'great image but where are the right angles that are given power to your image?', '2003-08-08 03:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(381603, 31814, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. Try playing with b&amp;w and maybe tinting the apples. It would give great depth to the apples. Currently the apples don''t pop out enough. Maybe with a little tweaking the apples would stand out more.</td>', 'I like the composition. Try playing with b&w and maybe tinting the apples. It would give great depth to the apples. Currently the apples don''t pop out enough. Maybe with a little tweaking the apples would stand out more.', '2003-08-08 03:29:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(381605, 32227, 10084, '<td valign="top">Compositon is nice.  Overexposed image. ISO , Exposure mode set too high. Interesting colors. Maybe b&amp;w.</td>', 'Compositon is nice.  Overexposed image. ISO , Exposure mode set too high. Interesting colors. Maybe b&w.', '2003-08-08 03:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(381622, 32162, 10739, '<td valign="top">the upper side is a bit dark</td>', 'the upper side is a bit dark', '2003-08-08 04:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(381623, 31770, 10739, '<td valign="top">the whole picture is blurry</td>', 'the whole picture is blurry', '2003-08-08 04:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(381624, 32137, 10739, '<td valign="top">the upper side is overexposed</td>', 'the upper side is overexposed', '2003-08-08 04:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(381625, 31397, 10739, '<td valign="top">actually I don''t see the tree makes the picture any better</td>', 'actually I don''t see the tree makes the picture any better', '2003-08-08 04:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(381627, 31952, 10739, '<td valign="top">it''s a good picture but actually I don''t see the right angles really strength the pic</td>', 'it''s a good picture but actually I don''t see the right angles really strength the pic', '2003-08-08 04:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(381628, 31931, 10739, '<td valign="top">do you think rigth angles really play an important role in the picture ?</td>', 'do you think rigth angles really play an important role in the picture ?', '2003-08-08 04:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(381629, 31998, 10739, '<td valign="top">right angles ?</td>', 'right angles ?', '2003-08-08 04:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(381631, 31939, 10739, '<td valign="top">it''s blurry</td>', 'it''s blurry', '2003-08-08 04:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(381632, 32065, 10739, '<td valign="top">the resolution is really poor. That make the picture horribly blurry. A bit off-topic also</td>', 'the resolution is really poor. That make the picture horribly blurry. A bit off-topic also', '2003-08-08 04:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(381633, 32072, 10739, '<td valign="top">not a very nice subject</td>', 'not a very nice subject', '2003-08-08 04:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(381634, 31907, 10739, '<td valign="top">it''s too bright. Some artifacts on the tip</td>', 'it''s too bright. Some artifacts on the tip', '2003-08-08 04:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(381635, 32185, 10739, '<td valign="top">what strength this picture is the contrast and the nice blue sky but not the right angles, even if they are present in the picture</td>', 'what strength this picture is the contrast and the nice blue sky but not the right angles, even if they are present in the picture', '2003-08-08 04:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(381638, 31663, 8643, '<td valign="top">A higher (square to the subject centre) camera position would have avoided the diverging verticals.</td>', 'A higher (square to the subject centre) camera position would have avoided the diverging verticals.', '2003-08-08 05:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(381639, 32162, 4258, '<td valign="top">Would like tjos to be sharper and better lit and with less noise</td>', 'Would like tjos to be sharper and better lit and with less noise', '2003-08-08 05:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(381640, 32048, 4258, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful composition!! Meets the Challenge but the uneven reflections in the lower third distracts</td>', 'What a wonderful composition!! Meets the Challenge but the uneven reflections in the lower third distracts', '2003-08-08 05:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(381642, 31881, 8987, '<td valign="top">no right angle?</td>', 'no right angle?', '2003-08-08 05:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(381643, 31823, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very ethereal. Composition is outstanding.</td>', 'Very ethereal. Composition is outstanding.', '2003-08-08 05:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(381645, 32025, 10084, '<td valign="top">A lot of noise. To high of an ISO setting. If auto bring down the setting and adjust manually.</td>', 'A lot of noise. To high of an ISO setting. If auto bring down the setting and adjust manually.', '2003-08-08 05:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(381646, 32221, 10084, '<td valign="top">Colors look washed out. This image would probably look very nice in b&amp;w. Composition is good.</td>', 'Colors look washed out. This image would probably look very nice in b&w. Composition is good.', '2003-08-08 05:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(381648, 31666, 4258, '<td valign="top">The background looks patchy and there is a lot of noise in the picture as well</td>', 'The background looks patchy and there is a lot of noise in the picture as well', '2003-08-08 05:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(381649, 31907, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is o.k. The white of the picture is giving the photo a washout look. I think changing the lighting would be nice. I like how the pencil is standing. Maybe if the photo was done in b&amp;w. I really like the way the shadow on the pencil was there , but wished that it had more contrast. A nice dark shadow maybe.</td>', 'Composition is o.k. The white of the picture is giving the photo a washout look. I think changing the lighting would be nice. I like how the pencil is standing. Maybe if the photo was done in b&w. I really like the way the shadow on the pencil was there , but wished that it had more contrast. A nice dark shadow maybe.', '2003-08-08 05:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(381650, 32235, 4258, '<td valign="top">Looks dull - try on a brighter day please</td>', 'Looks dull - try on a brighter day please', '2003-08-08 05:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(381651, 32245, 10084, '<td valign="top">The best composed piece of the contest. Reflections are beautiful. Love the lighting. Great b&amp;w look without taking it in b&amp;w. I can almost feel the cold metal of the socket.Focus is spot on.</td>', 'The best composed piece of the contest. Reflections are beautiful. Love the lighting. Great b&w look without taking it in b&w. I can almost feel the cold metal of the socket.Focus is spot on.', '2003-08-08 05:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(381652, 32255, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is nice. Wished that the focus was nicer. Looks good in b&amp;w. Play with depth of field a little more</td>', 'Composition is nice. Wished that the focus was nicer. Looks good in b&w. Play with depth of field a little more', '2003-08-08 05:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(381653, 31940, 4258, '<td valign="top">I don''t smoke and dont like smokers - still this is a well captured photo</td>', 'I don''t smoke and dont like smokers - still this is a well captured photo', '2003-08-08 05:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(381654, 32152, 10084, '<td valign="top">Colors of the flowers are nice. Composition is ok. I don''t like how the camera is focused in on the item in the back. Changing the depth of view from the background to the foreground would be great. Most interesting in the picture is the flower and not the item in the background.</td>', 'Colors of the flowers are nice. Composition is ok. I don''t like how the camera is focused in on the item in the back. Changing the depth of view from the background to the foreground would be great. Most interesting in the picture is the flower and not the item in the background.', '2003-08-08 05:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(381655, 32144, 4258, '<td valign="top">Totally out of focus and washed out - sorry have to give you a [2]</td>', 'Totally out of focus and washed out - sorry have to give you a [2]', '2003-08-08 05:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(381656, 31860, 10084, '<td valign="top">Looks great in b&amp;w. Directions of the pipes on the bottom brings your eyes to the sprinkler heads at the top makes this a very good composition. Focusing is great.</td>', 'Looks great in b&w. Directions of the pipes on the bottom brings your eyes to the sprinkler heads at the top makes this a very good composition. Focusing is great.', '2003-08-08 05:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(381658, 31516, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is excellent. Focusing on the drill is interesting. I think I would have focus in on the metal and blurred out the drill to show movement. The picture still looks very good.</td>', 'Composition is excellent. Focusing on the drill is interesting. I think I would have focus in on the metal and blurred out the drill to show movement. The picture still looks very good.', '2003-08-08 05:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(381659, 31882, 4258, '<td valign="top">This could have been a great picture - but if your title emphasises the spiderweb then it should occupy more of the frame</td>', 'This could have been a great picture - but if your title emphasises the spiderweb then it should occupy more of the frame', '2003-08-08 05:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(381661, 32162, 10084, '<td valign="top">Picture looks overexposed makes it look washed out.The metal looks like it is glowing and blurry. Toning down the flash or lighting would give the picture contrast. Right now it looks flat.</td>', 'Picture looks overexposed makes it look washed out.The metal looks like it is glowing and blurry. Toning down the flash or lighting would give the picture contrast. Right now it looks flat.', '2003-08-08 05:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(381662, 31931, 4258, '<td valign="top">A picture with an out of focus foreground is usually unappealing to human eye - In my opinion foreground should be blurred only if you want it to be insignificant</td>', 'A picture with an out of focus foreground is usually unappealing to human eye - In my opinion foreground should be blurred only if you want it to be insignificant', '2003-08-08 06:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(381663, 32057, 10084, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast. Picture looks too bright.  Yeah, flourscent light plays havoc with digital cameras. Maybe set the ISO setting a little bit lower. You probably get some good shadows. I think the composition would look nicer if you stood closer to one side of the shelves and shot along it. Picture looks busy.</td>', 'Not enough contrast. Picture looks too bright.  Yeah, flourscent light plays havoc with digital cameras. Maybe set the ISO setting a little bit lower. You probably get some good shadows. I think the composition would look nicer if you stood closer to one side of the shelves and shot along it. Picture looks busy.', '2003-08-08 06:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(381664, 32228, 4258, '<td valign="top">This picture has great potential. I would like to see it without the top cropped off...</td>', 'This picture has great potential. I would like to see it without the top cropped off...', '2003-08-08 06:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(381665, 31548, 10084, '<td valign="top">Picture is a bit washed out and overexposed. Try bring the ISO or exposure setting down would help on a bright and sunny day. It would also give greater depth in the picture. Some of the shadows are nice, but better if setting was lowered. Composition is very good.</td>', 'Picture is a bit washed out and overexposed. Try bring the ISO or exposure setting down would help on a bright and sunny day. It would also give greater depth in the picture. Some of the shadows are nice, but better if setting was lowered. Composition is very good.', '2003-08-08 06:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(381666, 31770, 4258, '<td valign="top">Totally out of focus - sorry [2] only</td>', 'Totally out of focus - sorry [2] only', '2003-08-08 06:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(381667, 32153, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I love the pattern from the glass object.</td>', 'Great composition. I love the pattern from the glass object.', '2003-08-08 06:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(381668, 31265, 4258, '<td valign="top">2 points minus for the shadow on the top center [8]</td>', '2 points minus for the shadow on the top center [8]', '2003-08-08 06:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(381669, 31998, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is nice. Don''t like the lighting coming from the bottom messes up the contrast. The light is giving it an orange hue. This may look very good in black &amp; white. It would probably bring the shadow out more and give it more depth.</td>', 'Composition is nice. Don''t like the lighting coming from the bottom messes up the contrast. The light is giving it an orange hue. This may look very good in black & white. It would probably bring the shadow out more and give it more depth.', '2003-08-08 06:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(381688, 31274, 9603, '<td valign="top">there are too much watches</td>', 'there are too much watches', '2003-08-08 06:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(381691, 31380, 9603, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2003-08-08 06:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(381694, 31628, 9603, '<td valign="top">RIGHT angles!</td>', 'RIGHT angles!', '2003-08-08 06:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(381697, 32037, 9603, '<td valign="top">good, lol</td>', 'good, lol', '2003-08-08 06:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(381700, 31491, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is nice. Colors are washed out. Bad contrast. Sunny days usually causes this.Set your aperture lower and less light will enter your camera giving it more depth. The shadows will become darker giving a more 3d look. Living in San Francisco I have to play with my settings a lot because of the bad sunlight.</td>', 'Composition is nice. Colors are washed out. Bad contrast. Sunny days usually causes this.Set your aperture lower and less light will enter your camera giving it more depth. The shadows will become darker giving a more 3d look. Living in San Francisco I have to play with my settings a lot because of the bad sunlight.', '2003-08-08 06:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(381702, 32174, 10084, '<td valign="top">Using a polarized lense will keep the reflections down. The composition is pretty good but the reflections are a little distraction.</td>', 'Using a polarized lense will keep the reflections down. The composition is pretty good but the reflections are a little distraction.', '2003-08-08 07:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(381705, 32201, 10084, '<td valign="top">Wished there was a little more focus on the metal piece. Lower f stop in the manual setting would help bring out the right angle. Very interesting composition, I like it a lot.</td>', 'Wished there was a little more focus on the metal piece. Lower f stop in the manual setting would help bring out the right angle. Very interesting composition, I like it a lot.', '2003-08-08 07:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(381707, 31619, 10084, '<td valign="top">Image is a bit washed out, but that could be what you were planning. Gives it a kind of ghostly mood. Setting a lower F-stop would focus in on the headstone a little more and blur the one behind it giving more contrast.</td>', 'Image is a bit washed out, but that could be what you were planning. Gives it a kind of ghostly mood. Setting a lower F-stop would focus in on the headstone a little more and blur the one behind it giving more contrast.', '2003-08-08 07:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(381708, 31379, 10084, '<td valign="top">Picture has a lot of noise. Lighting may be too strong. Bring the ISO setting a bit lower. Decreasing the Exposure level should also help. These two things will give the pictures better contrast. Shadows and reflections would look a lot nicer.</td>', 'Picture has a lot of noise. Lighting may be too strong. Bring the ISO setting a bit lower. Decreasing the Exposure level should also help. These two things will give the pictures better contrast. Shadows and reflections would look a lot nicer.', '2003-08-08 07:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(381709, 32144, 10084, '<td valign="top">Washedout overexposed picture. Try lowering exposure setting, it will help on a bright day. Try infinity focus, it will give better focus to the fore and background. If you only want the bridge to be focus try landscape mode.</td>', 'Washedout overexposed picture. Try lowering exposure setting, it will help on a bright day. Try infinity focus, it will give better focus to the fore and background. If you only want the bridge to be focus try landscape mode.', '2003-08-08 07:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(381723, 31994, 10196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - my favourite this week! Very nice colour combination.<br/>I really like the black windows and the dark upper part of the building which almost looks like a larger window. - 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot - my favourite this week! Very nice colour combination.I really like the black windows and the dark upper part of the building which almost looks like a larger window. - 10', '2003-08-08 09:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(381725, 32052, 10196, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. The combination of regularity (right angles...) and irregularity makes a great photo. - 10.</td>', 'Very nice shot. The combination of regularity (right angles...) and irregularity makes a great photo. - 10.', '2003-08-08 09:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(381726, 31674, 10196, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I can almost feel the heat. - 9</td>', 'Nice shot. I can almost feel the heat. - 9', '2003-08-08 09:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(381728, 32053, 10196, '<td valign="top">I like this shot with the contrasty sign smack in the middle. I also like the fact the the sky is not solid blue. - 9</td>', 'I like this shot with the contrasty sign smack in the middle. I also like the fact the the sky is not solid blue. - 9', '2003-08-08 09:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(381729, 31570, 10196, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. One of the ten best this week. - 9</td>', 'This is a great shot. One of the ten best this week. - 9', '2003-08-08 09:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(381731, 31849, 10402, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see a lot of right angles giving strength to this image suggestive of the U.S. political right. The fabric has a lot of them, but they aren''t perceived as right angles by the eye. The image needs more depth of field to get all the buttons in focus, and more care with the lighting is needed; small specular highlights such as that on the SRT button are fine, but the glare on some of the other buttons is distracting.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see a lot of right angles giving strength to this image suggestive of the U.S. political right. The fabric has a lot of them, but they aren''t perceived as right angles by the eye. The image needs more depth of field to get all the buttons in focus, and more care with the lighting is needed; small specular highlights such as that on the SRT button are fine, but the glare on some of the other buttons is distracting.', '2003-08-08 09:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(381736, 31480, 3724, '<td valign="top">gritty quality.........</td>', 'gritty quality.........', '2003-08-08 09:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(381738, 32030, 10196, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. - 8</td>', 'Nice shot. - 8', '2003-08-08 09:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(381739, 32065, 10402, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see anything leaning here except a few minor plants in the foreground. And I don''t perceive many right angles giving strength to this image. It appears rather pixelated, making the image very blurry. Did you intend the right angles in the square pixels to meet the challenge criteria? Intentional pixelation can be a useful compositional device in digital photographs, but the pixels need to be large enough to make it obvious that''s what you are doing.</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see anything leaning here except a few minor plants in the foreground. And I don''t perceive many right angles giving strength to this image. It appears rather pixelated, making the image very blurry. Did you intend the right angles in the square pixels to meet the challenge criteria? Intentional pixelation can be a useful compositional device in digital photographs, but the pixels need to be large enough to make it obvious that''s what you are doing.', '2003-08-08 09:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(381740, 31882, 10196, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but I think I would have liked a bit lower or higher angle to make the spider webb more visible.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but I think I would have liked a bit lower or higher angle to make the spider webb more visible.', '2003-08-08 09:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(381741, 31895, 10196, '<td valign="top">Nice composition of the shot. I really like it.</td>', 'Nice composition of the shot. I really like it.', '2003-08-08 09:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(381743, 32052, 10402, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of right angles here, but they are perceived as squares, not angles. A minor point. More importantly, this image doesn''t have a center of interest, making it rather boring.</td>', 'There are a lot of right angles here, but they are perceived as squares, not angles. A minor point. More importantly, this image doesn''t have a center of interest, making it rather boring.', '2003-08-08 09:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(381744, 31388, 10402, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of right angles here, but they are perceived as rectangles, not angles. A minor point. More importantly, this image is poorly focused and doesn''t have a center of interest, making it rather boring.</td>', 'There are a lot of right angles here, but they are perceived as rectangles, not angles. A minor point. More importantly, this image is poorly focused and doesn''t have a center of interest, making it rather boring.', '2003-08-08 10:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(381748, 32128, 10196, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could have been a lot better if you had reframed it. Now, there are to many distractions. You could try to crop it a bit tighter right and bottom to remove the lamp posts and tree. I would also like to see a bit more space to the left of the crane. I gave it a 2.</td>', 'I think this shot could have been a lot better if you had reframed it. Now, there are to many distractions. You could try to crop it a bit tighter right and bottom to remove the lamp posts and tree. I would also like to see a bit more space to the left of the crane. I gave it a 2.', '2003-08-08 10:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(381751, 31823, 10196, '<td valign="top">Great composition and a perfect placement of the sun behind the statue. Good job! - 7</td>', 'Great composition and a perfect placement of the sun behind the statue. Good job! - 7', '2003-08-08 10:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(381752, 31624, 10768, '<td valign="top">Held my interest!  Vivid colors and good depth of field and sharpness.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Held my interest!  Vivid colors and good depth of field and sharpness.  One of my favorites.', '2003-08-08 10:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(381755, 31309, 10402, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern, but I don''t really understand the title. And I can''t find any right angles at all. I think you are trying to make the photo say something, but I''m afraid it doesn''t convey your message very well. Sorry.</td>', 'Interesting pattern, but I don''t really understand the title. And I can''t find any right angles at all. I think you are trying to make the photo say something, but I''m afraid it doesn''t convey your message very well. Sorry.', '2003-08-08 10:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(381757, 31773, 10275, '<td valign="top">You know, I actually like this shot. Not because, by now, I guessed who''s photo this is, but this has such a feeling in it. The fly &amp; the leaf are a bonus. The right angle not neccessarily make it stronger photo, but it is a very emotional. And the colour nicely contrasts with the gloominess of the water. Normally I would feel like brightening it, but that would take away from the whole feeling of it. If you don''t mind,  I will add it to my favourites after the challenge is over.</td>', 'You know, I actually like this shot. Not because, by now, I guessed who''s photo this is, but this has such a feeling in it. The fly & the leaf are a bonus. The right angle not neccessarily make it stronger photo, but it is a very emotional. And the colour nicely contrasts with the gloominess of the water. Normally I would feel like brightening it, but that would take away from the whole feeling of it. If you don''t mind,  I will add it to my favourites after the challenge is over.', '2003-08-08 10:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(381761, 32055, 10196, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could have came out a lot better if you had not blown out the sky (or perhaps it was a gray day?) and if some shadows was seen. Right now, the picture is a bit to dull for my taste.</td>', 'I think this shot could have came out a lot better if you had not blown out the sky (or perhaps it was a gray day?) and if some shadows was seen. Right now, the picture is a bit to dull for my taste.', '2003-08-08 10:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
