(382066, 31379, 10441, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, nice composition.</td>', 'Interesting shot, nice composition.', '2003-08-08 15:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(382067, 31663, 10441, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but remember the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Cool shot, but remember the rule of thirds.', '2003-08-08 15:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(382068, 31640, 10441, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nicely composed.</td>', 'Great shot, nicely composed.', '2003-08-08 15:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(382070, 32209, 10441, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Nice shot, fits the challenge well.', '2003-08-08 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(382077, 31653, 7682, '<td valign="top">Now there''s some right angles.  Nice work, like the blue hue</td>', 'Now there''s some right angles.  Nice work, like the blue hue', '2003-08-08 16:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(382079, 32243, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have used a higher camera angle to make the railing angles more prominent. It might not have worked, but its just a thought.</td>', 'I might have used a higher camera angle to make the railing angles more prominent. It might not have worked, but its just a thought.', '2003-08-08 16:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(382083, 32023, 10047, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little over exposed. I would have tried adjusting the brightness in an editing program.</td>', 'Maybe a little over exposed. I would have tried adjusting the brightness in an editing program.', '2003-08-08 16:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(382085, 31980, 10047, '<td valign="top">Sort of like my entry. The grid pattern strengthens the subject of the photo, and makes it stand out. Good job.</td>', 'Sort of like my entry. The grid pattern strengthens the subject of the photo, and makes it stand out. Good job.', '2003-08-08 16:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(382086, 31309, 9676, '<td valign="top">Aunque me lo critiquen a mi me encanta que saque fotos y lo amo igual.</td>', 'Aunque me lo critiquen a mi me encanta que saque fotos y lo amo igual.', '2003-08-08 16:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(382093, 32038, 10402, '<td valign="top">The challenge was to make an image using right angles, not an image depicting a right angle. The ornate decorations draw attention away from the subjects in this image. Perhaps that''s what you intended, but it is distracting to me. The subjects could use a bit of sharpening, but I don''t know how that would affect the rest of the image.</td>', 'The challenge was to make an image using right angles, not an image depicting a right angle. The ornate decorations draw attention away from the subjects in this image. Perhaps that''s what you intended, but it is distracting to me. The subjects could use a bit of sharpening, but I don''t know how that would affect the rest of the image.', '2003-08-08 16:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(382097, 31939, 10084, '<td valign="top">Picture is overexposed. Try turning the ISO down a bit. Sometimes if there''s too much light indoors you have to take it out of indoor mode and adjust manually. Composition is nice.</td>', 'Picture is overexposed. Try turning the ISO down a bit. Sometimes if there''s too much light indoors you have to take it out of indoor mode and adjust manually. Composition is nice.', '2003-08-08 17:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(382098, 31927, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice composition . I like the negative dark spaces. Colors are pretty good.</td>', 'Nice composition . I like the negative dark spaces. Colors are pretty good.', '2003-08-08 17:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(382103, 31666, 10084, '<td valign="top">Overexposed too much light hitting the camera. Lower the ISO setting on your camera. If it was on auto, try playing around with the manual settings. Was it taken in portrait mode?</td>', 'Overexposed too much light hitting the camera. Lower the ISO setting on your camera. If it was on auto, try playing around with the manual settings. Was it taken in portrait mode?', '2003-08-08 17:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(382104, 32137, 10084, '<td valign="top">Overexposed. Try bring the ISO setting down. If this was taken on auto play around with the manual setting. Downcast skies gives the light a hazy brightness. This should help out with the contrast.</td>', 'Overexposed. Try bring the ISO setting down. If this was taken on auto play around with the manual setting. Downcast skies gives the light a hazy brightness. This should help out with the contrast.', '2003-08-08 17:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(382106, 31985, 10890, '<td valign="top">Seems a little dark</td>', 'Seems a little dark', '2003-08-08 17:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(382107, 31520, 10890, '<td valign="top">Looks a little underexposed to me</td>', 'Looks a little underexposed to me', '2003-08-08 17:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(382109, 32040, 10084, '<td valign="top">Looks a little like a watercolor painting. Colors are interesting.</td>', 'Looks a little like a watercolor painting. Colors are interesting.', '2003-08-08 17:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(382110, 31514, 10196, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Simple and striking. 8</td>', 'I like this one. Simple and striking. 8', '2003-08-08 17:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(382112, 32153, 10196, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution.', '2003-08-08 17:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(382114, 31995, 10196, '<td valign="top">Very fine composition. I like the choosen colour tint. Perfect border. 8</td>', 'Very fine composition. I like the choosen colour tint. Perfect border. 8', '2003-08-08 17:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(382115, 32168, 10084, '<td valign="top">Subject matter is boring. Composition is not interesting. You have the idea of getting the roofline. The shape are nice. More interesting in you zoom in a little bit more or getting the corner of the building. The vertical line of the side of the building would add a little something. Exposure is pretty good.<br/>Remember it''s a digital camera. Don''t be afraid to take a lot of shots. Professional photographers take hundred or even thousands to get a few good shots.</td>', 'Subject matter is boring. Composition is not interesting. You have the idea of getting the roofline. The shape are nice. More interesting in you zoom in a little bit more or getting the corner of the building. The vertical line of the side of the building would add a little something. Exposure is pretty good.Remember it''s a digital camera. Don''t be afraid to take a lot of shots. Professional photographers take hundred or even thousands to get a few good shots.', '2003-08-08 17:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(382120, 32065, 10084, '<td valign="top">Overexposed picture. Turn down the ISO setting. If it''s on auto, play around with the manual mode. Are you taking the picture with 640X480? Use a higher pixel count and lower in a Photo program. It will give a better result then taking the picture in a lower resolution.</td>', 'Overexposed picture. Turn down the ISO setting. If it''s on auto, play around with the manual mode. Are you taking the picture with 640X480? Use a higher pixel count and lower in a Photo program. It will give a better result then taking the picture in a lower resolution.', '2003-08-08 17:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(382121, 32251, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns. Have you toy around with this composition in B&amp;W? Are you using a wide angle lense. Looks like there''s a little bit noise. Try turning down the ISO setting just a little bit and using a tripod.</td>', 'Nice patterns. Have you toy around with this composition in B&W? Are you using a wide angle lense. Looks like there''s a little bit noise. Try turning down the ISO setting just a little bit and using a tripod.', '2003-08-08 17:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(382124, 31913, 10084, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed. Set the ISO a little bit lower. I like the composition of your photo. The shadow of the ladder looks awesome.</td>', 'A little overexposed. Set the ISO a little bit lower. I like the composition of your photo. The shadow of the ladder looks awesome.', '2003-08-08 17:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(382125, 31265, 10890, '<td valign="top">I like your use of the hilight on the face of the dial</td>', 'I like your use of the hilight on the face of the dial', '2003-08-08 17:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(382126, 31520, 10084, '<td valign="top">Some noise. Lower your ISO setting a bit. Should reduce the noise. High F stop setting would give the pens more details. Composition is very nice.</td>', 'Some noise. Lower your ISO setting a bit. Should reduce the noise. High F stop setting would give the pens more details. Composition is very nice.', '2003-08-08 17:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(382127, 31553, 10890, '<td valign="top">This is neat.  I like the detail on the bricks.</td>', 'This is neat.  I like the detail on the bricks.', '2003-08-08 17:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(382140, 32029, 10970, '<td valign="top">This picture creates optical illusions.  I love the color.  I think this on is my favorite.</td>', 'This picture creates optical illusions.  I love the color.  I think this on is my favorite.', '2003-08-08 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(382141, 31823, 3569, '<td valign="top">I love this one,  simply beautiful colors and idea.  Great job.</td>', 'I love this one,  simply beautiful colors and idea.  Great job.', '2003-08-08 18:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(382142, 31771, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit to much contrast for me.  Great idea though.</td>', 'A bit to much contrast for me.  Great idea though.', '2003-08-08 18:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(382143, 31963, 3569, '<td valign="top">A little more of the lake and less black may have looked a bit better.</td>', 'A little more of the lake and less black may have looked a bit better.', '2003-08-08 18:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(382162, 32145, 6504, '<td valign="top">This is perfect for the challenge, and is photographically perfect.   8</td>', 'This is perfect for the challenge, and is photographically perfect.   8', '2003-08-08 19:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(382164, 31882, 6504, '<td valign="top">This is the most creative photo in the challenge in my opinion.  It is beautifully taken.</td>', 'This is the most creative photo in the challenge in my opinion.  It is beautifully taken.', '2003-08-08 19:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(382165, 32044, 6504, '<td valign="top"><br/>Excellent!  The lighting''s perfect.  The simplicity is great.  This is perfect for the challenge.e</td>', 'Excellent!  The lighting''s perfect.  The simplicity is great.  This is perfect for the challenge.e', '2003-08-08 19:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(382166, 32029, 6504, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  Nice lighting, shadows, colors.  Perfect for the challenge, and creative too.</td>', 'Beautifully done.  Nice lighting, shadows, colors.  Perfect for the challenge, and creative too.', '2003-08-08 19:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(382167, 31874, 9679, '<td valign="top">Certainly fits the challenge... nice work!</td>', 'Certainly fits the challenge... nice work!', '2003-08-08 19:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(382194, 31961, 9679, '<td valign="top">Everytime I look at this, I like it more, especially the wood tones and the intriguing designs at the center right. Nice composition!</td>', 'Everytime I look at this, I like it more, especially the wood tones and the intriguing designs at the center right. Nice composition!', '2003-08-08 19:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(382219, 31994, 7778, '<td valign="top">Great clarity and expanse of tone. One of my favourite shots in this challenge. Yet...<br/> <br/>I remain reserved about the composition, particularly the very narrow crop to the left of the light blue ''wing''. I would have preferred a more generous space, perhaps a 3rd of the distance between the windows, i.e. a measure relative to any ''given'' in the photo, to suggest continuity.<br/> <br/>The lighting too is questionable, since it is obviously natural, but reflects downward, off the ''wing''. I understand the choice for standing the image on end (to further enhance the abstraction suggested by the subject) but question the credibility of the resulting impression.<br/>To render the image horizontally (wing up) would, IMO, achieve a satisfying effect, albeit a different one. I also miss a clear definition of the ''wing'' against the sky, something that could, possibly,be achieved by sharpening the edges slightly. The double border is, IMO, more than is required to anchor the image in a page.<br/> <br/>Regarless of these (perceived) flaws, the photo is powerful and beautiful, and I''m grateful for having the opportunity to ''sink my teeth into something'' I can care about. :-)</td>', 'Great clarity and expanse of tone. One of my favourite shots in this challenge. Yet... I remain reserved about the composition, particularly the very narrow crop to the left of the light blue ''wing''. I would have preferred a more generous space, perhaps a 3rd of the distance between the windows, i.e. a measure relative to any ''given'' in the photo, to suggest continuity. The lighting too is questionable, since it is obviously natural, but reflects downward, off the ''wing''. I understand the choice for standing the image on end (to further enhance the abstraction suggested by the subject) but question the credibility of the resulting impression.To render the image horizontally (wing up) would, IMO, achieve a satisfying effect, albeit a different one. I also miss a clear definition of the ''wing'' against the sky, something that could, possibly,be achieved by sharpening the edges slightly. The double border is, IMO, more than is required to anchor the image in a page. Regarless of these (perceived) flaws, the photo is powerful and beautiful, and I''m grateful for having the opportunity to ''sink my teeth into something'' I can care about. :-)', '2003-08-08 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(382221, 32176, 8891, '<td valign="top">Real nice, like it a lot....miight have bisected the upper left corner of the building with the front metal structure and framed the latter so it comes to a point on the left edge of the frame.....Nice sunset.</td>', 'Real nice, like it a lot....miight have bisected the upper left corner of the building with the front metal structure and framed the latter so it comes to a point on the left edge of the frame.....Nice sunset.', '2003-08-08 20:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(382224, 31402, 7706, '<td valign="top">Boy does that remind me of one of my cats lol</td>', 'Boy does that remind me of one of my cats lol', '2003-08-08 20:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(382232, 31771, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is just great, lovely colors and texture... very inspired work... 10.</td>', 'this is just great, lovely colors and texture... very inspired work... 10.', '2003-08-08 20:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(382239, 32232, 1570, '<td valign="top">wow, just look at your wires on the left, poor little victims of re-sizing...</td>', 'wow, just look at your wires on the left, poor little victims of re-sizing...', '2003-08-08 20:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(382242, 32048, 1570, '<td valign="top">wow, very vivid, nice macro! something as simple as two forks, but so-o-o-o creative! 10.</td>', 'wow, very vivid, nice macro! something as simple as two forks, but so-o-o-o creative! 10.', '2003-08-08 20:59:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(382244, 31849, 1570, '<td valign="top">compliments to my fellow republican! what a creative take on the challenge, i like it a lot!</td>', 'compliments to my fellow republican! what a creative take on the challenge, i like it a lot!', '2003-08-08 21:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(382257, 31950, 9083, '<td valign="top">Love the compostotion great angles</td>', 'Love the compostotion great angles', '2003-08-08 21:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(382272, 32080, 3554, '<td valign="top">One of the best in show this week.  Nice work. I like it because it really uses right angles as the strength. Good clarity also.</td>', 'One of the best in show this week.  Nice work. I like it because it really uses right angles as the strength. Good clarity also.', '2003-08-08 22:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(382277, 31810, 3554, '<td valign="top">Excellent coloring including a very nice silloutte. I like the DOF also.  Having it centered makes it more more dramatic, I like that. <br/> <br/>One nit pick -- The right side of the cross between the pedestal and the cross beam has some "pixilation" There are two prominent spots near the cross beam among others.. It might be from the lighting not sure.  My eye is drawn to them everytime for some reason.</td>', 'Excellent coloring including a very nice silloutte. I like the DOF also.  Having it centered makes it more more dramatic, I like that.  One nit pick -- The right side of the cross between the pedestal and the cross beam has some "pixilation" There are two prominent spots near the cross beam among others.. It might be from the lighting not sure.  My eye is drawn to them everytime for some reason.', '2003-08-08 22:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(382278, 32027, 3554, '<td valign="top">Really meets the challenge. I wonder if it would be beter to have the middle be centered in the picture as well. so the left and right sides are symmetrical.</td>', 'Really meets the challenge. I wonder if it would be beter to have the middle be centered in the picture as well. so the left and right sides are symmetrical.', '2003-08-08 22:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(382279, 32054, 3554, '<td valign="top">Creative interepretation of the challenge. I might have titled it "Tic Tac Toe"  :)</td>', 'Creative interepretation of the challenge. I might have titled it "Tic Tac Toe"  :)', '2003-08-08 22:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(382280, 32053, 3554, '<td valign="top">I really like the blue in the background, but the blue spots on the white X are really distracting. Maybe pushed PS a little too far on this one.</td>', 'I really like the blue in the background, but the blue spots on the white X are really distracting. Maybe pushed PS a little too far on this one.', '2003-08-08 23:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(382282, 32048, 3554, '<td valign="top">While I wouldn''t dispute that you met the challenge, my eye is drawn more to the rounded part of the right fork than the right angles. I just don''t feel right angles from this composition.  <br/> <br/>Technically I would suggest a slightly different DOF with the forks sharper and the background quite a bit softer. I like the lighting quite a bit, though if I were going to nit pick I''d like to get rid of the flare on the rounded part of the right fork (maybe that''s why my eye goes there)</td>', 'While I wouldn''t dispute that you met the challenge, my eye is drawn more to the rounded part of the right fork than the right angles. I just don''t feel right angles from this composition.   Technically I would suggest a slightly different DOF with the forks sharper and the background quite a bit softer. I like the lighting quite a bit, though if I were going to nit pick I''d like to get rid of the flare on the rounded part of the right fork (maybe that''s why my eye goes there)', '2003-08-08 23:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(382284, 31514, 3554, '<td valign="top">Great choice of colors to contrast. The blue bars have some pixilation and the cropping of the top makes the blue bars feel a bit slanted and takes away from the right angle.  I''m not sure if they are slanted or it''s just the way they are framed.</td>', 'Great choice of colors to contrast. The blue bars have some pixilation and the cropping of the top makes the blue bars feel a bit slanted and takes away from the right angle.  I''m not sure if they are slanted or it''s just the way they are framed.', '2003-08-08 23:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(382285, 31806, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the tall format and the way the vines interrupt the edges so the right angles have their own identity instead of being lost in the stronger concept of squares. The white walls and pickets may be a bit bright, but toning them down would either reduce contrast or shadow details, both of which are good, so you probably made the right choice.</td>', 'I like the tall format and the way the vines interrupt the edges so the right angles have their own identity instead of being lost in the stronger concept of squares. The white walls and pickets may be a bit bright, but toning them down would either reduce contrast or shadow details, both of which are good, so you probably made the right choice.', '2003-08-08 23:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(382286, 31641, 3554, '<td valign="top">I love the different hues of gold, the lighting, the sharpness, etc. Great photo. While I wouldn''t say it doesn''t meet the challenge this shot does not strike me as having strength in the right angles themselves. In any shot where I have to think "Are there right angles" I think the submission fell a bit short of really using the photo to communicate the challenge. It''s still a great shot and even without a powerful tie to the challenge I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I love the different hues of gold, the lighting, the sharpness, etc. Great photo. While I wouldn''t say it doesn''t meet the challenge this shot does not strike me as having strength in the right angles themselves. In any shot where I have to think "Are there right angles" I think the submission fell a bit short of really using the photo to communicate the challenge. It''s still a great shot and even without a powerful tie to the challenge I gave it an 8.', '2003-08-08 23:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(382289, 31766, 10402, '<td valign="top">Some of the angles these acrobats make aren''t quite 90 degrees, but they''re close enough. You did a nice job of catching their act. The slight motion blur of the top person''s legs is a nice touch. The lighting is harsh, but there''s not much to be done about that California sun!</td>', 'Some of the angles these acrobats make aren''t quite 90 degrees, but they''re close enough. You did a nice job of catching their act. The slight motion blur of the top person''s legs is a nice touch. The lighting is harsh, but there''s not much to be done about that California sun!', '2003-08-08 23:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(382291, 32145, 3554, '<td valign="top">I like the title and the idea. The lighting has a bit of an orangish tungsten feel to it. With different lighting and a little sharper focus all around I''d have scored this a bit higher.</td>', 'I like the title and the idea. The lighting has a bit of an orangish tungsten feel to it. With different lighting and a little sharper focus all around I''d have scored this a bit higher.', '2003-08-08 23:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(382304, 31635, 4258, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge - but other than that doesn''t inspire much either technically or emotionally</td>', 'Fits the challenge - but other than that doesn''t inspire much either technically or emotionally', '2003-08-09 00:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(382305, 31766, 3981, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot.  Wish that guy on the top were not falling backwards!  Looks dangerous.  Color is good.  My only criticism would be that there is too much shadow on the fellow on the bottom.  A different angle (pun intended) maybe to get more of the sunshine on him?</td>', 'Very creative shot.  Wish that guy on the top were not falling backwards!  Looks dangerous.  Color is good.  My only criticism would be that there is too much shadow on the fellow on the bottom.  A different angle (pun intended) maybe to get more of the sunshine on him?', '2003-08-09 00:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(382307, 32174, 4258, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture - the water on top right is a bit too shiny. But  I can see many people hollering "does not meet the challenge" - It does for me :)</td>', 'Lovely picture - the water on top right is a bit too shiny. But  I can see many people hollering "does not meet the challenge" - It does for me :)', '2003-08-09 00:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(382309, 31942, 4258, '<td valign="top">how does your title apply here? <br/>Where is the hypotenuse?</td>', 'how does your title apply here? Where is the hypotenuse?', '2003-08-09 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(382310, 31933, 3981, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top 4 favorites this week, and I do hope it places in the top 3.  Composition is near perfect.  Technically very good also.  Meets the challenge well.  Good luck! 10.</td>', 'This is one of my top 4 favorites this week, and I do hope it places in the top 3.  Composition is near perfect.  Technically very good also.  Meets the challenge well.  Good luck! 10.', '2003-08-09 00:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(382311, 31886, 4258, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture - but care to explain about how right angles give strength to this picture?</td>', 'Lovely picture - but care to explain about how right angles give strength to this picture?', '2003-08-09 00:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(382312, 32042, 4258, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge but other than that it is bland - there is nothing in it which draws my eyes and holds my attention</td>', 'Meets the challenge but other than that it is bland - there is nothing in it which draws my eyes and holds my attention', '2003-08-09 00:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(382313, 32230, 3981, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning in its simplicity, line and form.  Composition is good, but the lighting is what make this shot IMHO.  Awesome.  One of my top three this week.  10.</td>', 'Simply stunning in its simplicity, line and form.  Composition is good, but the lighting is what make this shot IMHO.  Awesome.  One of my top three this week.  10.', '2003-08-09 00:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(382314, 31862, 3981, '<td valign="top">Great stop action here.  Sharp and clear. Cropping is near perfect.  Well done! 10.</td>', 'Great stop action here.  Sharp and clear. Cropping is near perfect.  Well done! 10.', '2003-08-09 00:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(382315, 31624, 3981, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors.  A polarizing filter, maybe?  Beautiful!  One of the top images for me this week.  9.</td>', 'Fantastic colors.  A polarizing filter, maybe?  Beautiful!  One of the top images for me this week.  9.', '2003-08-09 00:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(382316, 31766, 4258, '<td valign="top">I would have given you atleast 2 points more if the light on the acrobats was proper</td>', 'I would have given you atleast 2 points more if the light on the acrobats was proper', '2003-08-09 00:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(382317, 32156, 4258, '<td valign="top">Will work great for desolation ;)</td>', 'Will work great for desolation ;)', '2003-08-09 00:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(382318, 32072, 3981, '<td valign="top">I am scoring this image a 9 for its creativity.  The "angle" at which you shot it is what really sets it off for me.  The addition of the sun rays is great.  My only objection is that it is dull in color.  I''m not sure I would have made this black and white.  Nevertheless, it scores high for me.</td>', 'I am scoring this image a 9 for its creativity.  The "angle" at which you shot it is what really sets it off for me.  The addition of the sun rays is great.  My only objection is that it is dull in color.  I''m not sure I would have made this black and white.  Nevertheless, it scores high for me.', '2003-08-09 00:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(382319, 31841, 4258, '<td valign="top">What did you try to achieve by tilting the camera?</td>', 'What did you try to achieve by tilting the camera?', '2003-08-09 00:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(382320, 31784, 3981, '<td valign="top">The sharpness and clarity of this shot are near perfect!  I really had to study this one because I thought the books were falling off the table and finally concluded you have black and blue posterboard (or something similar) pushed together.  Composition is as good as it gets.  A 9 from me.</td>', 'The sharpness and clarity of this shot are near perfect!  I really had to study this one because I thought the books were falling off the table and finally concluded you have black and blue posterboard (or something similar) pushed together.  Composition is as good as it gets.  A 9 from me.', '2003-08-09 00:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(382321, 32226, 4258, '<td valign="top">Needs better D0F</td>', 'Needs better D0F', '2003-08-09 00:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(382322, 31862, 6388, '<td valign="top">i know they''re hurdles, but I''d have liked this better without the person.  interesting subject, nice perspective and crop, although I might have cropped out the black part in the top right.  good job</td>', 'i know they''re hurdles, but I''d have liked this better without the person.  interesting subject, nice perspective and crop, although I might have cropped out the black part in the top right.  good job', '2003-08-09 00:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(382323, 32029, 3981, '<td valign="top">I love this image and contemplated doing something very similar.  So glad I didn''t, because yours is so good.  I particularly like the lighting and the use of black in the background.  A 9 from me.</td>', 'I love this image and contemplated doing something very similar.  So glad I didn''t, because yours is so good.  I particularly like the lighting and the use of black in the background.  A 9 from me.', '2003-08-09 00:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(382324, 32153, 3981, '<td valign="top">This gets a 9 from me for its utter simplicity and creativity.  To show only clear acrylic over the black and white was a stroke of genius.  Lighting is also very good.</td>', 'This gets a 9 from me for its utter simplicity and creativity.  To show only clear acrylic over the black and white was a stroke of genius.  Lighting is also very good.', '2003-08-09 00:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
