(382338, 32204, 3981, '<td valign="top">Talk about your ingenious ideas!  You and one other person came up with an idea I never would have thought of.  I love the clarity and sharpness of this image.  Close focus makes the shot, IMHO. Lighting is very good.  I might have cropped a little differently, but still a 9 from me.</td>', 'Talk about your ingenious ideas!  You and one other person came up with an idea I never would have thought of.  I love the clarity and sharpness of this image.  Close focus makes the shot, IMHO. Lighting is very good.  I might have cropped a little differently, but still a 9 from me.', '2003-08-09 00:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(382339, 32052, 4258, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge BUT lacks a point of interest - try with putting a prop or a subject into the photo</td>', 'meets the challenge BUT lacks a point of interest - try with putting a prop or a subject into the photo', '2003-08-09 00:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(382341, 31548, 6388, '<td valign="top">who cares if the front is blown out a little.  this is fantastic. beautiful texture, great composition. i like the feeling of depth, although I might like it a bit more if you used a wider lens...were you zoomed all the way out?  If you were, it would bring the far wall into focus a bit better.  Who knows, maybe your cam doesn''t do that...if that''s the case, double congrats on a great shot.</td>', 'who cares if the front is blown out a little.  this is fantastic. beautiful texture, great composition. i like the feeling of depth, although I might like it a bit more if you used a wider lens...were you zoomed all the way out?  If you were, it would bring the far wall into focus a bit better.  Who knows, maybe your cam doesn''t do that...if that''s the case, double congrats on a great shot.', '2003-08-09 00:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(382343, 31480, 6388, '<td valign="top">I know, stupid nitpicking, but too bad you didn''t have shorter hair.  then you''d get your whole head in the square.  not gonna mark you down for it mind you. :)  neat idea, excellent crop.   Pedro</td>', 'I know, stupid nitpicking, but too bad you didn''t have shorter hair.  then you''d get your whole head in the square.  not gonna mark you down for it mind you. :)  neat idea, excellent crop.   Pedro', '2003-08-09 00:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(382345, 32201, 6388, '<td valign="top">i love stuff like this.  nice feel to it.  I might have cropped out a bit of the dead space on the right, but that''s just me - nothing wrong with your crop as is.</td>', 'i love stuff like this.  nice feel to it.  I might have cropped out a bit of the dead space on the right, but that''s just me - nothing wrong with your crop as is.', '2003-08-09 00:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(382346, 32010, 6388, '<td valign="top">don''t listen to those who complain about nudes.  This is a great shot that fits the challenge well.  To add a little depth, I might have added a few more right angles - her shoulder, elbow, knees...sometimes you gotta smack these guys in the face so they get it :)</td>', 'don''t listen to those who complain about nudes.  This is a great shot that fits the challenge well.  To add a little depth, I might have added a few more right angles - her shoulder, elbow, knees...sometimes you gotta smack these guys in the face so they get it :)', '2003-08-09 00:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(382347, 31781, 4258, '<td valign="top">Great sculpture - The colors on FREE are washed out and the body is too dark</td>', 'Great sculpture - The colors on FREE are washed out and the body is too dark', '2003-08-09 00:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(382348, 32062, 4258, '<td valign="top">Nice texture of the bark...</td>', 'Nice texture of the bark...', '2003-08-09 00:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(382349, 31939, 6388, '<td valign="top">the lighting is a little harsh, and it''s a bit blurry.  shooting glass can be hard like that - a polarizing filter would have done wonders.  you can clean some up with photoshop, but the filter is the best way to go.  also, I might have cropped the image more on the right - being able to see the bottom of the window takes some of the flow out of the pic.  good effort.</td>', 'the lighting is a little harsh, and it''s a bit blurry.  shooting glass can be hard like that - a polarizing filter would have done wonders.  you can clean some up with photoshop, but the filter is the best way to go.  also, I might have cropped the image more on the right - being able to see the bottom of the window takes some of the flow out of the pic.  good effort.', '2003-08-09 00:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(382350, 31966, 4258, '<td valign="top">great action shot - but where is the right angle?</td>', 'great action shot - but where is the right angle?', '2003-08-09 00:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(382351, 32027, 6388, '<td valign="top">interesting.  i think I''d have liked to see you take the bottom of the pic right to the floor - i think it would have added some power to the shot.  i really like the lines though.</td>', 'interesting.  i think I''d have liked to see you take the bottom of the pic right to the floor - i think it would have added some power to the shot.  i really like the lines though.', '2003-08-09 00:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(382352, 31812, 6388, '<td valign="top">lots going on in this pic.  our little friend gets a bit lost in the business of it.  taking about 10 steps to your left would have put the calf against a more contrasting background - just a thought.  Pedro</td>', 'lots going on in this pic.  our little friend gets a bit lost in the business of it.  taking about 10 steps to your left would have put the calf against a more contrasting background - just a thought.  Pedro', '2003-08-09 00:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
