(382357, 32036, 6388, '<td valign="top">a little too much black at the bottom methinks.  love the purple mountains against the silhouetted foreground.  crop 1.5 inches or so off the bottom and you have a top notch shot.</td>', 'a little too much black at the bottom methinks.  love the purple mountains against the silhouetted foreground.  crop 1.5 inches or so off the bottom and you have a top notch shot.', '2003-08-09 00:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(382359, 31662, 6388, '<td valign="top">great colour contrast.  lighting is nice as well.  good job.</td>', 'great colour contrast.  lighting is nice as well.  good job.', '2003-08-09 00:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(382360, 32065, 6388, '<td valign="top">not sure why this is so grainy - either your cam resolution is just too low for this kind of shot, or you used digital zoom, either in the cam or with software later.  make sure you cam is set to the highest resolution and don''t mess with it too much afterwards.  PM me if you need any help.  Pedro</td>', 'not sure why this is so grainy - either your cam resolution is just too low for this kind of shot, or you used digital zoom, either in the cam or with software later.  make sure you cam is set to the highest resolution and don''t mess with it too much afterwards.  PM me if you need any help.  Pedro', '2003-08-09 00:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(382361, 31993, 4258, '<td valign="top">Better lighting will make this a great photo</td>', 'Better lighting will make this a great photo', '2003-08-09 00:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(382362, 31651, 6388, '<td valign="top">something makes me want to see more of this angry princess...<br/> <br/>neat shot.  like the idea, and the execution (pun also intended) works as well.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'something makes me want to see more of this angry princess... neat shot.  like the idea, and the execution (pun also intended) works as well. Pedro', '2003-08-09 00:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
