(382365, 31608, 2612, '<td valign="top">This is one of the photos where I can not explain why it works for me, but it does. It looks like a candid, but strong line created by the leg creates a surprisingly strong composition.</td>', 'This is one of the photos where I can not explain why it works for me, but it does. It looks like a candid, but strong line created by the leg creates a surprisingly strong composition.', '2003-08-09 01:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(382370, 32253, 2612, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition with the right angle in the wood and the foliage just peeking through from behind. I''m not sure where your auto focus locked, but the board on the left seems a little out of focus. I''m not sure how bleached the wood was from the sun, but seems a little bright. You might try the same shot ealier or later in the day when the sun is not so harsh and you have more side lighting to bring out the grain in the wood.</td>', 'Interesting composition with the right angle in the wood and the foliage just peeking through from behind. I''m not sure where your auto focus locked, but the board on the left seems a little out of focus. I''m not sure how bleached the wood was from the sun, but seems a little bright. You might try the same shot ealier or later in the day when the sun is not so harsh and you have more side lighting to bring out the grain in the wood.', '2003-08-09 01:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(382374, 31863, 8891, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, like the bright primary colors, nice exposure</td>', 'Interesting image, like the bright primary colors, nice exposure', '2003-08-09 01:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(382376, 31894, 2612, '<td valign="top">I like your interpretation of right angles. From a technique point of view the one thing I would point out is the lamp at the top being out of focus. I''m sure this was a depth of field problem, but maybe it would just be better to crop it out if you cannot pull it into focus. We know it''s a lamp post and the right angle for me would be the crossing streets.</td>', 'I like your interpretation of right angles. From a technique point of view the one thing I would point out is the lamp at the top being out of focus. I''m sure this was a depth of field problem, but maybe it would just be better to crop it out if you cannot pull it into focus. We know it''s a lamp post and the right angle for me would be the crossing streets.', '2003-08-09 01:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(382378, 31640, 8891, '<td valign="top">Excellent BW....wonderful textures....</td>', 'Excellent BW....wonderful textures....', '2003-08-09 01:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(382382, 32203, 8891, '<td valign="top">this is an exciting image with its use of the red, like the red, white, and black bold colors in it, the pink does not work for me.</td>', 'this is an exciting image with its use of the red, like the red, white, and black bold colors in it, the pink does not work for me.', '2003-08-09 01:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(382384, 31807, 8891, '<td valign="top">nice job, but abe don''t look like abe so much here, I''m missing him in this. Like the BG colors very much and the pano cut.</td>', 'nice job, but abe don''t look like abe so much here, I''m missing him in this. Like the BG colors very much and the pano cut.', '2003-08-09 01:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(382385, 32045, 2612, '<td valign="top">I like your interpretation of the challenge and the composition of the image. Given the precision of the joinery, I think sharp focus would be more effective. With a stationary subject you can use a tripod or bench to hold the camera steady. This should help with sharp focus even if there is not much light.</td>', 'I like your interpretation of the challenge and the composition of the image. Given the precision of the joinery, I think sharp focus would be more effective. With a stationary subject you can use a tripod or bench to hold the camera steady. This should help with sharp focus even if there is not much light.', '2003-08-09 01:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(382386, 32035, 8891, '<td valign="top">OK....the woman is pretty and quite shapely, but she totally ditracts fromt he right angles and she is the strength of the image.....great image nonetheless.</td>', 'OK....the woman is pretty and quite shapely, but she totally ditracts fromt he right angles and she is the strength of the image.....great image nonetheless.', '2003-08-09 01:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
