(382394, 31338, 2612, '<td valign="top">I really like how this photo addresses the right angle challenge. The soft white right angle in front of the repeating dark angles is great. The same layering can be found in the airy green leaves of the tree and the white fabric. Very creative and well executed.</td>', 'I really like how this photo addresses the right angle challenge. The soft white right angle in front of the repeating dark angles is great. The same layering can be found in the airy green leaves of the tree and the white fabric. Very creative and well executed.', '2003-08-09 01:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
