(382409, 32156, 2612, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t like the blur with the falling chunk of wall, but it does help indicate movement. The huge white area of wall is also a little distracting. But, I know how difficult it is to get a photo like this when everything is moving around you, so I am going to give the score a difficult boost. The tonality of the worker is excellent. Get rid of the part of the lower wall and the right angles and texture of the worker will probably stand out more.</td>', 'At first I didn''t like the blur with the falling chunk of wall, but it does help indicate movement. The huge white area of wall is also a little distracting. But, I know how difficult it is to get a photo like this when everything is moving around you, so I am going to give the score a difficult boost. The tonality of the worker is excellent. Get rid of the part of the lower wall and the right angles and texture of the worker will probably stand out more.', '2003-08-09 01:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(382410, 31939, 7869, '<td valign="top">looks like you need a tripod. Focus is very soft. Good idea for the challenge</td>', 'looks like you need a tripod. Focus is very soft. Good idea for the challenge', '2003-08-09 01:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
