(382450, 31292, 3554, '<td valign="top">While there are a lot of different angles in this shot (90 degree and otherwise) I don''t see "right angles" as being a strength of this shot. If the challenge had been "angles" this would be a great entry. I like the color of the sky and the dark foreground.</td>', 'While there are a lot of different angles in this shot (90 degree and otherwise) I don''t see "right angles" as being a strength of this shot. If the challenge had been "angles" this would be a great entry. I like the color of the sky and the dark foreground.', '2003-08-09 02:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(382451, 31862, 3554, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot with some action to it. I like it. Simple but effective and right angles are prominent.</td>', 'Nice clear shot with some action to it. I like it. Simple but effective and right angles are prominent.', '2003-08-09 02:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(382452, 31957, 3554, '<td valign="top">really clear shot, I like the blue in the background but the leaf in the bottom right is a bit distracting. As are places where the blue material is bunched up (wrinkled). I think this meets the challenge well.</td>', 'really clear shot, I like the blue in the background but the leaf in the bottom right is a bit distracting. As are places where the blue material is bunched up (wrinkled). I think this meets the challenge well.', '2003-08-09 02:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(382453, 32245, 3554, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea but the shot feels uninspired. There''s no story here.</td>', 'Not a bad idea but the shot feels uninspired. There''s no story here.', '2003-08-09 03:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(382454, 32137, 3554, '<td valign="top">Great subject. It has a hazy feel to it, either from the natural light or from trying to brighten a bit too much in PS?</td>', 'Great subject. It has a hazy feel to it, either from the natural light or from trying to brighten a bit too much in PS?', '2003-08-09 03:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(382455, 31640, 3554, '<td valign="top">Some good detail. Would have been great if you could get the prominent bolt in the top right a bit more in focus.</td>', 'Some good detail. Would have been great if you could get the prominent bolt in the top right a bit more in focus.', '2003-08-09 03:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(382457, 31480, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very creative interpretation...Right angles AND digital photography...</td>', 'Very creative interpretation...Right angles AND digital photography...', '2003-08-09 03:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(382460, 32145, 9906, '<td valign="top">Heesh.....I had to think about this one for a second or two...</td>', 'Heesh.....I had to think about this one for a second or two...', '2003-08-09 03:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(382461, 31543, 5822, '<td valign="top">Neat abstract...I like the color and the way you''ve brought out the texture. And even though I find the highlight area a bit too hot, I like the contrast here. There''s a bit too much noise in the image, but I think it adds to the photo.</td>', 'Neat abstract...I like the color and the way you''ve brought out the texture. And even though I find the highlight area a bit too hot, I like the contrast here. There''s a bit too much noise in the image, but I think it adds to the photo.', '2003-08-09 03:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(382462, 32253, 5822, '<td valign="top">Focus is soft and composition uninteresting.  Plus, I don''t really get the impression that the strong point of this photo, if there is one, is the right angle at the top.</td>', 'Focus is soft and composition uninteresting.  Plus, I don''t really get the impression that the strong point of this photo, if there is one, is the right angle at the top.', '2003-08-09 03:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(382466, 32246, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, but I don''t find right angles of the pier to be the strong point of the image...Rather, the background hills with it''s strong color and the water seem to have a much greater impact for me, than the pier, which acts only as a way of leading the eye in to the BG</td>', 'Beautiful picture, but I don''t find right angles of the pier to be the strong point of the image...Rather, the background hills with it''s strong color and the water seem to have a much greater impact for me, than the pier, which acts only as a way of leading the eye in to the BG', '2003-08-09 03:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(382467, 32053, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the way the sign contrasts with the sky, but I think you did a bit too much post processing of the color and saturation. I also find the composition to be too static.</td>', 'I like the way the sign contrasts with the sky, but I think you did a bit too much post processing of the color and saturation. I also find the composition to be too static.', '2003-08-09 03:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(382468, 31594, 5822, '<td valign="top">Strong point of the photo is not the right angles, but of the cute and cuddly creatures...I also like the contrast between subjects and earth. Good texture and detail presented.</td>', 'Strong point of the photo is not the right angles, but of the cute and cuddly creatures...I also like the contrast between subjects and earth. Good texture and detail presented.', '2003-08-09 03:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(382469, 32168, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good exposure but the tree obstructing the view ruins the picture for me. I do like the way the blue sky contrasts with the stone of the architecture.</td>', 'Good exposure but the tree obstructing the view ruins the picture for me. I do like the way the blue sky contrasts with the stone of the architecture.', '2003-08-09 04:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(382478, 32224, 9668, '<td valign="top">Very nice silloutte, and I love the theme...so true, so true</td>', 'Very nice silloutte, and I love the theme...so true, so true', '2003-08-09 05:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(382481, 32238, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the abstractionism of this photo, and how it seems like its in the middle of nowhere :)</td>', 'I like the abstractionism of this photo, and how it seems like its in the middle of nowhere :)', '2003-08-09 05:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(382483, 32062, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool Fence!</td>', 'Cool Fence!', '2003-08-09 05:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(382493, 31771, 10420, '<td valign="top">Too much comporession/pixelation. Nice right angle though.</td>', 'Too much comporession/pixelation. Nice right angle though.', '2003-08-09 06:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(382494, 31950, 7151, '<td valign="top">Great catch.  The right angles work great here, not only do the strength of the lines in the building itself work, but they create the nice opposing angles in the reflection, increasing that strength.  Two nit-picks:  its got quite a bit of compression artifacts - the image is less than 50k, so don''t compress so much next time (or was bandwidth an issue?); and it could have been cropped maybe a degree or so to the right.  But those are minor points.  Nice work.</td>', 'Great catch.  The right angles work great here, not only do the strength of the lines in the building itself work, but they create the nice opposing angles in the reflection, increasing that strength.  Two nit-picks:  its got quite a bit of compression artifacts - the image is less than 50k, so don''t compress so much next time (or was bandwidth an issue?); and it could have been cropped maybe a degree or so to the right.  But those are minor points.  Nice work.', '2003-08-09 06:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(382495, 31615, 7151, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Excellent use of the theme.  Was that lone cloud in there on purpose?  I like it, it adds to the mood.</td>', 'Very cool.  Excellent use of the theme.  Was that lone cloud in there on purpose?  I like it, it adds to the mood.', '2003-08-09 06:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(382497, 32204, 10419, '<td valign="top">hey, you did good job on this one.</td>', 'hey, you did good job on this one.', '2003-08-09 06:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(382498, 32203, 10419, '<td valign="top">well, what can I say... not too shabby :-))</td>', 'well, what can I say... not too shabby :-))', '2003-08-09 06:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(382499, 31818, 7151, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a little more contrast or better focus on the arm, to make it stand out from the wall.  As it is, the photo looks a bit flat.  And with the title, I would have liked to see the hand - its sort of intrinsic to the gesture of taking an oath.  Nice idea for the challenge.</td>', 'I would have liked a little more contrast or better focus on the arm, to make it stand out from the wall.  As it is, the photo looks a bit flat.  And with the title, I would have liked to see the hand - its sort of intrinsic to the gesture of taking an oath.  Nice idea for the challenge.', '2003-08-09 06:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(382500, 32075, 10419, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective. Great right angles. It looks almost abstract. Nicely done.</td>', 'Cool perspective. Great right angles. It looks almost abstract. Nicely done.', '2003-08-09 06:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(382502, 32167, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very creative take. Good DOF. Effective composition. 8</td>', 'Very creative take. Good DOF. Effective composition. 8', '2003-08-09 06:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(382503, 32195, 7151, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t get it.  If there''s a purpose to your hand and whatever your holding, besides making a right angle, I don''t understand.  The lighting''s a bit dull and the focus is so-so.  Composition might be OK, if I understood the concept.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t get it.  If there''s a purpose to your hand and whatever your holding, besides making a right angle, I don''t understand.  The lighting''s a bit dull and the focus is so-so.  Composition might be OK, if I understood the concept.', '2003-08-09 06:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(382504, 31749, 10419, '<td valign="top">Wow, very creative. Nice saturation and warmth. I would have left a tiny more space at the bottom. But well done and deserves 8.</td>', 'Wow, very creative. Nice saturation and warmth. I would have left a tiny more space at the bottom. But well done and deserves 8.', '2003-08-09 06:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(382505, 32211, 10419, '<td valign="top">Sharp. Pleasing abstract. Good warm colour and light.</td>', 'Sharp. Pleasing abstract. Good warm colour and light.', '2003-08-09 06:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(382506, 32138, 7151, '<td valign="top">Its DVD night!  I think a deeper DOF would have made a stronger image, but maybe that''s just a matter of taste.  I also thing a little higher angle would have added strength to the angles.  An OK idea, I just think it needed a little more work.</td>', 'Its DVD night!  I think a deeper DOF would have made a stronger image, but maybe that''s just a matter of taste.  I also thing a little higher angle would have added strength to the angles.  An OK idea, I just think it needed a little more work.', '2003-08-09 06:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(382507, 31624, 10419, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Good exposure and colour. I would have waited for the person on the lower right to pass and position the green post a little separate from the castle (space them out more) as they compete for attention. But otherwise nice pic.</td>', 'Great shot. Good exposure and colour. I would have waited for the person on the lower right to pass and position the green post a little separate from the castle (space them out more) as they compete for attention. But otherwise nice pic.', '2003-08-09 06:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(382508, 32252, 10419, '<td valign="top">Clever composition.</td>', 'Clever composition.', '2003-08-09 06:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(382509, 32228, 7151, '<td valign="top">Colors are nice.  Composition is a bit messy.  I''ll give it a "just barely" on the challenge, because I think the vertical lines are the strongest aspect, not the angles.  But they are there.</td>', 'Colors are nice.  Composition is a bit messy.  I''ll give it a "just barely" on the challenge, because I think the vertical lines are the strongest aspect, not the angles.  But they are there.', '2003-08-09 06:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(382511, 31993, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Effective angle, but I would suggest to ad more light.</td>', 'Very creative. Effective angle, but I would suggest to ad more light.', '2003-08-09 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(382512, 32054, 10419, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Dead on. I lacks distortion which is good. Could have added some colour through saturation adjustments, but that depends on your taste.</td>', 'Great shot. Dead on. I lacks distortion which is good. Could have added some colour through saturation adjustments, but that depends on your taste.', '2003-08-09 06:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(382513, 31961, 7151, '<td valign="top">Too much maybe... The jango tower by itself, with a blank or uncluttered background would have been stronger.  This image has a lot of "warring" lines and angles, which leaves it a little muddled looking.  Nice idea that I think you made too complicated.  Focus and lighting are so-so.</td>', 'Too much maybe... The jango tower by itself, with a blank or uncluttered background would have been stronger.  This image has a lot of "warring" lines and angles, which leaves it a little muddled looking.  Nice idea that I think you made too complicated.  Focus and lighting are so-so.', '2003-08-09 06:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(382514, 32046, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Great composition. Nice abstract. I would have bumped the colour up a tiny bit.</td>', 'Very well done. Great composition. Nice abstract. I would have bumped the colour up a tiny bit.', '2003-08-09 06:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(382515, 31788, 7151, '<td valign="top">Great expample of where the "lines" don''t have to be so obvious, but the right angles really jump out.  Sharpness and lighting are good.  Well done.</td>', 'Great expample of where the "lines" don''t have to be so obvious, but the right angles really jump out.  Sharpness and lighting are good.  Well done.', '2003-08-09 06:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(382516, 31378, 10419, '<td valign="top">Too bad the whole imae is not sharp (different depth of field). Like the rusty detail in the wiring. Perhaps a higher point of veiw would have given a better sense of right angles.</td>', 'Too bad the whole imae is not sharp (different depth of field). Like the rusty detail in the wiring. Perhaps a higher point of veiw would have given a better sense of right angles.', '2003-08-09 06:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(382517, 31756, 10419, '<td valign="top">Really good right angles here. But the subject itself doesn''t hold enough interest for the viewer (just IMO).</td>', 'Really good right angles here. But the subject itself doesn''t hold enough interest for the viewer (just IMO).', '2003-08-09 06:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(382519, 31849, 10419, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and good colour. It''s quite busy too.  I am affraid it doesn''t have much to to with the proposed challenge though, but you might have meant it as a humor.</td>', 'Very sharp and good colour. It''s quite busy too.  I am affraid it doesn''t have much to to with the proposed challenge though, but you might have meant it as a humor.', '2003-08-09 06:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
