(382547, 32036, 10196, '<td valign="top">Beatutiful colours in the sky and the mountains. Too much black for my taste. I would have liked it better with only the upper left "right angle" framing the shot - I also think you could have had a bit lower POV to have the "frame" closer to the sky.</td>', 'Beatutiful colours in the sky and the mountains. Too much black for my taste. I would have liked it better with only the upper left "right angle" framing the shot - I also think you could have had a bit lower POV to have the "frame" closer to the sky.', '2003-08-09 07:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(382548, 32179, 10084, '<td valign="top">Reflections are beautiful. Looks like an abstract painting. Obviously a reflection of a building of another building. The shoot seems too busy. Hard to see details. If this was a photo on color study it''s great.</td>', 'Reflections are beautiful. Looks like an abstract painting. Obviously a reflection of a building of another building. The shoot seems too busy. Hard to see details. If this was a photo on color study it''s great.', '2003-08-09 08:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(382549, 32163, 10084, '<td valign="top">The greens are beautiful. The bright color of the algae brings the foreground out of the picture. Interesting shadows in the algae. Might look good in b&amp;w too.</td>', 'The greens are beautiful. The bright color of the algae brings the foreground out of the picture. Interesting shadows in the algae. Might look good in b&w too.', '2003-08-09 08:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(382550, 31651, 3032, '<td valign="top">Excellent Photo. Interesting and appealing setup; The goodies on the skin create a Persian/Indian kind of mood, the light accentuates the body sculpture and indicates I am looking at a female. The fantasy does the rest: Nubian princess kills the bad Kalif, frees her lover and together they rule the empire from their palace in a oase setting. :)<br/>My favourite for this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent Photo. Interesting and appealing setup; The goodies on the skin create a Persian/Indian kind of mood, the light accentuates the body sculpture and indicates I am looking at a female. The fantasy does the rest: Nubian princess kills the bad Kalif, frees her lover and together they rule the empire from their palace in a oase setting. :)My favourite for this challenge.', '2003-08-09 08:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(382551, 32253, 10084, '<td valign="top">A lot of noise. Try bring the ISO setting down would keep the noise down. It will give you better details. Don''t like the composition. It''s not very interesting. Right now your eyes focus on background behind the fence. Maybe lower the EV setting would give you some nice shadows which would give you nice contrast.</td>', 'A lot of noise. Try bring the ISO setting down would keep the noise down. It will give you better details. Don''t like the composition. It''s not very interesting. Right now your eyes focus on background behind the fence. Maybe lower the EV setting would give you some nice shadows which would give you nice contrast.', '2003-08-09 08:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(382552, 32159, 10084, '<td valign="top">Too much noise. Lower ISO setting should help. I do like the composition. Maybe play with b&amp;w. A bit washed out. Lower the EV setting should give you better contrast and shadows.</td>', 'Too much noise. Lower ISO setting should help. I do like the composition. Maybe play with b&w. A bit washed out. Lower the EV setting should give you better contrast and shadows.', '2003-08-09 08:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(382553, 32035, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Feels like a watercolor. Reflections of the floor makes your almost feel the surface. Beautiful shadows. The shadow of the face makes you wonder what she''s thinking.</td>', 'Great composition. Feels like a watercolor. Reflections of the floor makes your almost feel the surface. Beautiful shadows. The shadow of the face makes you wonder what she''s thinking.', '2003-08-09 08:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(382554, 31961, 10084, '<td valign="top">A bit of noise. Turn down ISO a little. I think the composition who be nicer if you didn''t included the black frame. Too many shapes.</td>', 'A bit of noise. Turn down ISO a little. I think the composition who be nicer if you didn''t included the black frame. Too many shapes.', '2003-08-09 08:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(382555, 32029, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good composition. A bit of noise. Turn down ISO setting a little. Shadows are really good. I like the shapes that they make.</td>', 'Good composition. A bit of noise. Turn down ISO setting a little. Shadows are really good. I like the shapes that they make.', '2003-08-09 08:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(382556, 31293, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. I just wished there was a little more focus. Animal fur gives very good shadows when correctly focus. This must have been a tough shoot. Love the expression on the dog.</td>', 'I like the composition. I just wished there was a little more focus. Animal fur gives very good shadows when correctly focus. This must have been a tough shoot. Love the expression on the dog.', '2003-08-09 08:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(382557, 31329, 2612, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of the challenge. Maybe try to keep the walls verticle and use a tripod or bench to hold the camera still so you an use a smaller apeture (higher f-stop value) for more depth of field.</td>', 'Good interpretation of the challenge. Maybe try to keep the walls verticle and use a tripod or bench to hold the camera still so you an use a smaller apeture (higher f-stop value) for more depth of field.', '2003-08-09 08:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(382559, 32185, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Good composition. Main subject is a bit dark. If the top of the signal lights had more contrast the shadows would be beautiful.</td>', 'Nice colors. Good composition. Main subject is a bit dark. If the top of the signal lights had more contrast the shadows would be beautiful.', '2003-08-09 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(382561, 31426, 10084, '<td valign="top">Needs cropping. Too many items in the picture. Play with the Aperture.Focusing the rider and blurring  out the background with give the picture some depth.</td>', 'Needs cropping. Too many items in the picture. Play with the Aperture.Focusing the rider and blurring  out the background with give the picture some depth.', '2003-08-09 08:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(382562, 32070, 10084, '<td valign="top">Composition is good. Silhouette is perfect. Background is nice.</td>', 'Composition is good. Silhouette is perfect. Background is nice.', '2003-08-09 09:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
