(382684, 32238, 8891, '<td valign="top">The hi keyness of this is not working for me as you lose some of the upper square. The wainscoating needs straightening.  Another good idea.</td>', 'The hi keyness of this is not working for me as you lose some of the upper square. The wainscoating needs straightening.  Another good idea.', '2003-08-09 12:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
