(382948, 31543, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nothing personal mr/ms. photographer and this is not directed at you at all....but what it is with frames on this site....you won''t allow spot editing and expect the world out of a camera but you allow frames????????????????? Ahhh that''s better.  Sorry.  This is great!!! love the textures and I even like the framing you used as it fits the image so well.  Excllent shot!</td>', 'Nothing personal mr/ms. photographer and this is not directed at you at all....but what it is with frames on this site....you won''t allow spot editing and expect the world out of a camera but you allow frames????????????????? Ahhh that''s better.  Sorry.  This is great!!! love the textures and I even like the framing you used as it fits the image so well.  Excllent shot!', '2003-08-10 01:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(382949, 31939, 8891, '<td valign="top">is the soft focus on perhaps, if so adds a bit of dreamy quality to this. but the color is so bland.</td>', 'is the soft focus on perhaps, if so adds a bit of dreamy quality to this. but the color is so bland.', '2003-08-10 01:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
