(383172, 32211, 2567, '<td valign="top">Like the coloring and composition.  Meets the challenge in an interesting way.  Good luck.</td>', 'Like the coloring and composition.  Meets the challenge in an interesting way.  Good luck.', '2003-08-10 15:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(383174, 31665, 2567, '<td valign="top">This is really pushing to meet the challenge.  Looks out of focus to me however I''m guessing that was intentional...  Good composition.</td>', 'This is really pushing to meet the challenge.  Looks out of focus to me however I''m guessing that was intentional...  Good composition.', '2003-08-10 16:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(383175, 31666, 2567, '<td valign="top">This is stretching to meet the challenge.  It looks overexposed, maybe intentional.  Good composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is stretching to meet the challenge.  It looks overexposed, maybe intentional.  Good composition.  Good luck.', '2003-08-10 16:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(383177, 31881, 2567, '<td valign="top">Creativity good, composition and color good.  I like the way he is slightly out of focus.  Good luck.</td>', 'Creativity good, composition and color good.  I like the way he is slightly out of focus.  Good luck.', '2003-08-10 16:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(383178, 32227, 2567, '<td valign="top">This shot looks out of focus to me.  Not sure of the coloring.  Good composition though.  Would like to see this one taken at a different time of day I think.</td>', 'This shot looks out of focus to me.  Not sure of the coloring.  Good composition though.  Would like to see this one taken at a different time of day I think.', '2003-08-10 16:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(383180, 31876, 2567, '<td valign="top">This is a stretch for the challenge.  I like the single line of colors.</td>', 'This is a stretch for the challenge.  I like the single line of colors.', '2003-08-10 16:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(383182, 31770, 2567, '<td valign="top">This looks to be behind glass to me.  A different angle may have been more effective.  Nice colors.</td>', 'This looks to be behind glass to me.  A different angle may have been more effective.  Nice colors.', '2003-08-10 16:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(383183, 32159, 2567, '<td valign="top">This is really stretching it for the challenge.  Photo could be larger</td>', 'This is really stretching it for the challenge.  Photo could be larger', '2003-08-10 16:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(383184, 32201, 3638, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I would have liked to see a bit more detail of the bridge in the background though.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I would have liked to see a bit more detail of the bridge in the background though.', '2003-08-10 16:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(383187, 32040, 3638, '<td valign="top">Over edited and unnatural looking.</td>', 'Over edited and unnatural looking.', '2003-08-10 16:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(383188, 31520, 3638, '<td valign="top">Try to get rid of the large shadow up the middle.</td>', 'Try to get rid of the large shadow up the middle.', '2003-08-10 16:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(383192, 31315, 3638, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Love the lighting you used.  Not sure those are right angles though.</td>', 'Great shot.  Love the lighting you used.  Not sure those are right angles though.', '2003-08-10 16:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(383207, 31951, 3638, '<td valign="top">Try to move a bit closer to eliminate the tree in the bottom left corner</td>', 'Try to move a bit closer to eliminate the tree in the bottom left corner', '2003-08-10 16:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(383212, 32193, 10848, '<td valign="top">great picture</td>', 'great picture', '2003-08-10 16:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(383218, 31807, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo...the contrast between light and shadow is awesome!</td>', 'Beautiful photo...the contrast between light and shadow is awesome!', '2003-08-10 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(383220, 31749, 10848, '<td valign="top">good eye..imaginative</td>', 'good eye..imaginative', '2003-08-10 17:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(383226, 32174, 10848, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot...love the angle of the waves and the sun cascading off the water!!</td>', 'beautiful shot...love the angle of the waves and the sun cascading off the water!!', '2003-08-10 17:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(383228, 31871, 10848, '<td valign="top">love it!!</td>', 'love it!!', '2003-08-10 17:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(383229, 31650, 10848, '<td valign="top">cute concept..love the facial expressions!</td>', 'cute concept..love the facial expressions!', '2003-08-10 17:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(383237, 31265, 11092, '<td valign="top">Simple,clean and effective. very striking. I love it.</td>', 'Simple,clean and effective. very striking. I love it.', '2003-08-10 17:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(383254, 31379, 10402, '<td valign="top">I like the contrasts here, both of the materials and the pointed vs rounded right angles. The lighting and depth of field emphasize the three dimensionality of the subject, although as a viewer, I wish all the metal cubes were in better focus.  The cubes embedded at an angle add interest, as do the imperfections in the surfaces. The cloth surface the cubes are sitting on doesn''t really match the rest of the photo; a flat surface may have worked better.</td>', 'I like the contrasts here, both of the materials and the pointed vs rounded right angles. The lighting and depth of field emphasize the three dimensionality of the subject, although as a viewer, I wish all the metal cubes were in better focus.  The cubes embedded at an angle add interest, as do the imperfections in the surfaces. The cloth surface the cubes are sitting on doesn''t really match the rest of the photo; a flat surface may have worked better.', '2003-08-10 17:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(383265, 31315, 5266, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, lighting and subject of your photo but I don''t feel it meets the challenge.</td>', 'I love the colors, lighting and subject of your photo but I don''t feel it meets the challenge.', '2003-08-10 18:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(383268, 32058, 5266, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the "right angle".  Nice shell and composition though.</td>', 'I don''t see the "right angle".  Nice shell and composition though.', '2003-08-10 18:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(383269, 31402, 5266, '<td valign="top">That is one BEAUTIFUL cat in the box!!!  Great eyes - hope you make a print for your wall, it''s a winner!!!</td>', 'That is one BEAUTIFUL cat in the box!!!  Great eyes - hope you make a print for your wall, it''s a winner!!!', '2003-08-10 18:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(383271, 32156, 10402, '<td valign="top">Just the right amount of motion blur here. It would have been nice if the man''s hair could be distinguished from the background, although the lighting may have been beyond your control. I don''t care for the gratuitous use of "right angles" in the title, and the borders detract rather than add to this photo.</td>', 'Just the right amount of motion blur here. It would have been nice if the man''s hair could be distinguished from the background, although the lighting may have been beyond your control. I don''t care for the gratuitous use of "right angles" in the title, and the borders detract rather than add to this photo.', '2003-08-10 18:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(383274, 31998, 2170, '<td valign="top">these aren\''t right angles.  nice photo, though.  maybe better in b/w?</td>', 'these aren\''t right angles.  nice photo, though.  maybe better in b/w?', '2003-08-10 18:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(383277, 32245, 2170, '<td valign="top">This would be awesome in b/w and with a seamless background.</td>', 'This would be awesome in b/w and with a seamless background.', '2003-08-10 18:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(383278, 32218, 2170, '<td valign="top">I dislike the coloring in this.  It detracts from the photo.</td>', 'I dislike the coloring in this.  It detracts from the photo.', '2003-08-10 18:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(383280, 31816, 2170, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Very well done.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Very well done.  Congratulations.', '2003-08-10 18:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(383281, 31995, 2170, '<td valign="top">Or is it 9:00 in the evening?....  the world will never know......</td>', 'Or is it 9:00 in the evening?....  the world will never know......', '2003-08-10 18:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(383282, 31980, 2170, '<td valign="top">great contrast and angle.  love it.</td>', 'great contrast and angle.  love it.', '2003-08-10 18:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
