(383508, 31889, 10084, '<td valign="top">Shooting through glass is tough because of reflections or focus. On this piece its the focus, but that is what makes this good. I like how the picture looks monochromatic except the siren lights and the intersection sign. Give you a feeling of what happened. Composition is good. I like the angle you used.</td>', 'Shooting through glass is tough because of reflections or focus. On this piece its the focus, but that is what makes this good. I like how the picture looks monochromatic except the siren lights and the intersection sign. Give you a feeling of what happened. Composition is good. I like the angle you used.', '2003-08-11 00:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
