(383869, 32075, 8860, '<td valign="top">I love the design in this shot. Great colours and composition. One point - I wonder if you''d rotated, until the vertical ''line'' was 90 degrees, whether that would have made the shot neater? I think the design would have been even stronger as a pattern, making it more difficult to discern the subject. [9]</td>', 'I love the design in this shot. Great colours and composition. One point - I wonder if you''d rotated, until the vertical ''line'' was 90 degrees, whether that would have made the shot neater? I think the design would have been even stronger as a pattern, making it more difficult to discern the subject. [9]', '2003-08-11 05:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
