(384327, 31749, 8981, '<td valign="top">Natural right angles can be hard to find, but I think you did a good job.  I also like the fact that you enhanced the angles with the background.  The colors are rich and I really enjoy the lighting.  Good job!</td>', 'Natural right angles can be hard to find, but I think you did a good job.  I also like the fact that you enhanced the angles with the background.  The colors are rich and I really enjoy the lighting.  Good job!', '2003-08-11 12:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
