(384835, 31292, 9643, '<td valign="top">The eerie evening glow and especially the fading into infinity makes this photo riveting in my opinion   10</td>', 'The eerie evening glow and especially the fading into infinity makes this photo riveting in my opinion   10', '2003-08-11 22:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(384837, 31950, 9643, '<td valign="top">The balance in the reflection in this image is outstanding and the creation of an additional right angle with the reflection is wonderfully creative.  I''m impressed with the thought that went into this composition.</td>', 'The balance in the reflection in this image is outstanding and the creation of an additional right angle with the reflection is wonderfully creative.  I''m impressed with the thought that went into this composition.', '2003-08-11 22:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(384840, 32241, 9643, '<td valign="top">An excellent example of a good case for not judging the photo on thumbnail because this really opens up.  I''m wondering how it would look with a very blue, unclouded sky.</td>', 'An excellent example of a good case for not judging the photo on thumbnail because this really opens up.  I''m wondering how it would look with a very blue, unclouded sky.', '2003-08-11 22:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(384841, 32128, 9643, '<td valign="top">To me the bottom 2/3 detracts from the top (object) of the photo.  I probably would have cropped it.</td>', 'To me the bottom 2/3 detracts from the top (object) of the photo.  I probably would have cropped it.', '2003-08-11 22:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(384842, 32247, 9643, '<td valign="top">A  little bit too blue but great angles and shadow</td>', 'A  little bit too blue but great angles and shadow', '2003-08-11 22:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(384866, 31968, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this one, though I find the amount of open sky at the top distracts me a little from the artwork - when I scroll until the left-hand bar almost touches the top of the frame, it looks even better, tighter, to me. And where/what is this, anyway? It''s fascinating.</td>', 'I like this one, though I find the amount of open sky at the top distracts me a little from the artwork - when I scroll until the left-hand bar almost touches the top of the frame, it looks even better, tighter, to me. And where/what is this, anyway? It''s fascinating.', '2003-08-11 23:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(384871, 31615, 8637, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Thanks for a very emotive shot.  Would it be improved by cropping down to only the gray rock?  In any case, great image.</td>', 'Very cool!  Thanks for a very emotive shot.  Would it be improved by cropping down to only the gray rock?  In any case, great image.', '2003-08-12 00:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(384872, 31292, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting...I''d like to use this for a brochure cover...will it be for sale?<br/></td>', 'Beautiful lighting...I''d like to use this for a brochure cover...will it be for sale?', '2003-08-12 00:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(384873, 32073, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great capture...excellent colors and the gray sky works well.</td>', 'Great capture...excellent colors and the gray sky works well.', '2003-08-12 00:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(384874, 32023, 8637, '<td valign="top">Little blurry...maybe that was intended but seems to detract.</td>', 'Little blurry...maybe that was intended but seems to detract.', '2003-08-12 00:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(384875, 31480, 8637, '<td valign="top">Excellent PS work...really like the colors and the contrasty/grainy imagery.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Excellent PS work...really like the colors and the contrasty/grainy imagery.  Very nice work.', '2003-08-12 00:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(384876, 31292, 8911, '<td valign="top">Pretty - I wish it were just a bit crisper, the blur/artifacts in the foreground are a bit distracting to me - but the colors and composition are lovely.</td>', 'Pretty - I wish it were just a bit crisper, the blur/artifacts in the foreground are a bit distracting to me - but the colors and composition are lovely.', '2003-08-12 00:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(384885, 32054, 8911, '<td valign="top">The wall/windows by themselves might be a bit bland - but the reflections captured spice it up nicely. I do wish there had been more reflections, though I don''t think you were trying to make them your subject.</td>', 'The wall/windows by themselves might be a bit bland - but the reflections captured spice it up nicely. I do wish there had been more reflections, though I don''t think you were trying to make them your subject.', '2003-08-12 00:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(384888, 31674, 8911, '<td valign="top">I especially like the colors in this one - it''s a bit grainy and/or blurry here and there. I''m not sure how well that could be controlled with the lighting involved, but it does detract from the power of the photo. I like the effect of heavy lines of the grill against the much softer, paler cup''s outline, and the reflections in the cup are a nice touch as well.</td>', 'I especially like the colors in this one - it''s a bit grainy and/or blurry here and there. I''m not sure how well that could be controlled with the lighting involved, but it does detract from the power of the photo. I like the effect of heavy lines of the grill against the much softer, paler cup''s outline, and the reflections in the cup are a nice touch as well.', '2003-08-12 00:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(384892, 31378, 8911, '<td valign="top">I hate to say it, but I can''t even tell for sure that the grate is angled rather than rounded holds - the shot is so horizontal that even the part that seems to be in focus isn''t clear if it has right angles or not. It''s a neat concept, but I think a slightly higher angle might have worked better.</td>', 'I hate to say it, but I can''t even tell for sure that the grate is angled rather than rounded holds - the shot is so horizontal that even the part that seems to be in focus isn''t clear if it has right angles or not. It''s a neat concept, but I think a slightly higher angle might have worked better.', '2003-08-12 00:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(384893, 31637, 8911, '<td valign="top">While this definitely has right angles in it, I''m not quite sure they''re the strength - and the varying pieces of the little light getting cut off in the mirror is kind of distracting, I fear. It''s an interesting concept (and a strange little light), but it doesn''t really work (at least for me).</td>', 'While this definitely has right angles in it, I''m not quite sure they''re the strength - and the varying pieces of the little light getting cut off in the mirror is kind of distracting, I fear. It''s an interesting concept (and a strange little light), but it doesn''t really work (at least for me).', '2003-08-12 00:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(384894, 32023, 8911, '<td valign="top">Lots of right angles, definitely! The way the details are partly lost on the most brightly-illuminated is distracting, though, and I''m not quite sure what the "draw" of the photo is meant to be, or where to rest my attention.</td>', 'Lots of right angles, definitely! The way the details are partly lost on the most brightly-illuminated is distracting, though, and I''m not quite sure what the "draw" of the photo is meant to be, or where to rest my attention.', '2003-08-12 00:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(384895, 32159, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photo and a neat composition - but why so small? A photo for a challenge can be a lot larger, and thereby more engaging.</td>', 'This is a cute photo and a neat composition - but why so small? A photo for a challenge can be a lot larger, and thereby more engaging.', '2003-08-12 00:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(384899, 32144, 8911, '<td valign="top">A neat concept and composition. I''m not sure if it''s the haze or actual lack of focus, but it doesn''t seem like anything is quite in focus, which is a pity. It would be neat if the bridge pieces were in sharp focus, drawing the eye more completely to them and the involved angles.</td>', 'A neat concept and composition. I''m not sure if it''s the haze or actual lack of focus, but it doesn''t seem like anything is quite in focus, which is a pity. It would be neat if the bridge pieces were in sharp focus, drawing the eye more completely to them and the involved angles.', '2003-08-12 00:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(384900, 31770, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a neat concept and composition for this...but the focus isn''t super-crisp even on the pieces/parts of the board that are in focus, and the reflections are distracting. Did you use a tripod? Is there something that could have reduced or eliminated the reflections, maybe a bit of cloth spread above the camera''s reach so that only flat cloth was reflected?</td>', 'This is a neat concept and composition for this...but the focus isn''t super-crisp even on the pieces/parts of the board that are in focus, and the reflections are distracting. Did you use a tripod? Is there something that could have reduced or eliminated the reflections, maybe a bit of cloth spread above the camera''s reach so that only flat cloth was reflected?', '2003-08-12 00:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(384902, 32254, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a neat photo; I like the way you caught it frozen mid-step. I''m not really convinced that the right angles here contribute to the strength of the photo, though they don''t damage it, either. There''s some graininess evident, particularly in the shadows.</td>', 'This is a neat photo; I like the way you caught it frozen mid-step. I''m not really convinced that the right angles here contribute to the strength of the photo, though they don''t damage it, either. There''s some graininess evident, particularly in the shadows.', '2003-08-12 00:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(384904, 31484, 8911, '<td valign="top">Very, very pretty. I fear my eye is drawn more to the curvy parts than the straight or right-angled parts, though that may be more a sign of what I tend to look at than the photo''s use of right angles.</td>', 'Very, very pretty. I fear my eye is drawn more to the curvy parts than the straight or right-angled parts, though that may be more a sign of what I tend to look at than the photo''s use of right angles.', '2003-08-12 00:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(384906, 31659, 8911, '<td valign="top">Lots of right angles, and the patterning is sort of neat, but I don''t find this photo really engaging. It meets the topic challenge well, it just doesn''t draw me in beyond that.</td>', 'Lots of right angles, and the patterning is sort of neat, but I don''t find this photo really engaging. It meets the topic challenge well, it just doesn''t draw me in beyond that.', '2003-08-12 00:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(384907, 31863, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is disturbing on so many levels, not least of which is that she''s recognizable. It''s a good photograph, just blinking at the Lego Hermione. :) Nice capture - and a nice choice of an unusual subject, as well.</td>', 'This is disturbing on so many levels, not least of which is that she''s recognizable. It''s a good photograph, just blinking at the Lego Hermione. :) Nice capture - and a nice choice of an unusual subject, as well.', '2003-08-12 00:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(384908, 32188, 8911, '<td valign="top">Really, really nice photograph. Definitely uses right angles, very crisp and clear, good composition. I could easily see this being used in a poster or an ad. I do wonder if there''s any way that the "glare" off the near ends of the darts could have been removed, or if that''s just an inevitable consequence of the thinning plastic there, if the rest of it is to be well-lit.</td>', 'Really, really nice photograph. Definitely uses right angles, very crisp and clear, good composition. I could easily see this being used in a poster or an ad. I do wonder if there''s any way that the "glare" off the near ends of the darts could have been removed, or if that''s just an inevitable consequence of the thinning plastic there, if the rest of it is to be well-lit.', '2003-08-12 00:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(384909, 32209, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice composition and shot. I especially like the echoing right angles in the reflections, and the way it makes this into a multi-layered photo, as it were.</td>', 'This is a really nice composition and shot. I especially like the echoing right angles in the reflections, and the way it makes this into a multi-layered photo, as it were.', '2003-08-12 00:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(384911, 31997, 8911, '<td valign="top">Lovely, lovely. I''m not completely convinced that right angles are the strength of this, or at least not the sole strength, but they''re definitely present. The colors, the composition - this is just gorgeous. Nicely framed without being static.</td>', 'Lovely, lovely. I''m not completely convinced that right angles are the strength of this, or at least not the sole strength, but they''re definitely present. The colors, the composition - this is just gorgeous. Nicely framed without being static.', '2003-08-12 00:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(384922, 32245, 8367, '<td valign="top">Lefty loosey. I love 12 points. <br/>Very nice capture. Great composition and clarity.</td>', 'Lefty loosey. I love 12 points. Very nice capture. Great composition and clarity.', '2003-08-12 01:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(384929, 31292, 9550, '<td valign="top">Great Photo. I almost did one like this. i like the depth of field. The tree line up in your face and the power lines forever.</td>', 'Great Photo. I almost did one like this. i like the depth of field. The tree line up in your face and the power lines forever.', '2003-08-12 01:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(384930, 32136, 6413, '<td valign="top">I really like this but there is a bit too much glare</td>', 'I really like this but there is a bit too much glare', '2003-08-12 02:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(384931, 32193, 8981, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty cool picture.  I like the backlighting and the focus on the spider.  Unfortunatly my focus is drawn directly to the spider, and not to the right angles.</td>', 'This is a pretty cool picture.  I like the backlighting and the focus on the spider.  Unfortunatly my focus is drawn directly to the spider, and not to the right angles.', '2003-08-12 02:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(384933, 32203, 6413, '<td valign="top">very nice - the red looks really good</td>', 'very nice - the red looks really good', '2003-08-12 02:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(384934, 32033, 8981, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot.  It was a good concept, but the aren''t a whole lot of right angles in the shadow, which happens to be the main focus.  Speaking of focus, I''m sure you know by now that this picture is a little out of focus.  Oddly enough it''s a little grainy too.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot.  It was a good concept, but the aren''t a whole lot of right angles in the shadow, which happens to be the main focus.  Speaking of focus, I''m sure you know by now that this picture is a little out of focus.  Oddly enough it''s a little grainy too.', '2003-08-12 02:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(384935, 32214, 8981, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but I think the tinting actually takes away from this shot.  Good idea though.</td>', 'I like this shot, but I think the tinting actually takes away from this shot.  Good idea though.', '2003-08-12 02:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(384937, 32235, 8981, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Lots of angles, and they are easy to find.  The color seems a bit dull though.</td>', 'Very nice.  Lots of angles, and they are easy to find.  The color seems a bit dull though.', '2003-08-12 02:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(384939, 31980, 8981, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture!!  The colors are great and I like the composition as a photo on it''s own.  I don''t think the ball was right for this challenge though, it draws focus and is the opposite of the right angles.  Would have been great in the contrast challenge!</td>', 'I really like this picture!!  The colors are great and I like the composition as a photo on it''s own.  I don''t think the ball was right for this challenge though, it draws focus and is the opposite of the right angles.  Would have been great in the contrast challenge!', '2003-08-12 02:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(384941, 31426, 8981, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I don''t think this fits the challenge at all.  I really like the picture on it''s own, but applying the challenge criteria it just doesn''t stand up.  On the plus side, it''s really sharp and the colors are nice.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t think this fits the challenge at all.  I really like the picture on it''s own, but applying the challenge criteria it just doesn''t stand up.  On the plus side, it''s really sharp and the colors are nice.', '2003-08-12 02:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(384942, 31594, 8981, '<td valign="top">Cute picture... not really right for the challenge though.  Nice contrast and good colors.  Lighting is a little harsh, but sometimes you can''t help that.</td>', 'Cute picture... not really right for the challenge though.  Nice contrast and good colors.  Lighting is a little harsh, but sometimes you can''t help that.', '2003-08-12 02:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(384943, 31818, 8981, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I feel like the contrast isn''t it''s best in this picture, I almost missed the arm completely.  The tinting doesn''t help much and I think you could have used brighter lighting.  Good effort!</td>', 'Good idea.  I feel like the contrast isn''t it''s best in this picture, I almost missed the arm completely.  The tinting doesn''t help much and I think you could have used brighter lighting.  Good effort!', '2003-08-12 02:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(384944, 31665, 8981, '<td valign="top">Now, I know that there is a right angle with her hands, but honestly all I can do is look down the blouse.  Picture is a little grainy, maybe too sharp.</td>', 'Now, I know that there is a right angle with her hands, but honestly all I can do is look down the blouse.  Picture is a little grainy, maybe too sharp.', '2003-08-12 02:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(384946, 31966, 8981, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, and it would have been awesome in the speed challenge.  Not so sure it fits here though.  I see a few right angles, but I honestly have to search for them.  Really is a sweet action shot though.</td>', 'Cool picture, and it would have been awesome in the speed challenge.  Not so sure it fits here though.  I see a few right angles, but I honestly have to search for them.  Really is a sweet action shot though.', '2003-08-12 02:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(384948, 32230, 8981, '<td valign="top">Ooooh! I like this one!  Very nice composition and it''s very crisp!</td>', 'Ooooh! I like this one!  Very nice composition and it''s very crisp!', '2003-08-12 02:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(384949, 32167, 8981, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s paper??  That''s amazing!  Good work here, very creative.</td>', 'Wow!  That''s paper??  That''s amazing!  Good work here, very creative.', '2003-08-12 02:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(384952, 32201, 8981, '<td valign="top">The main subject is a little out of focus and the colors in this picture are a little dark.</td>', 'The main subject is a little out of focus and the colors in this picture are a little dark.', '2003-08-12 02:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(384953, 32227, 8981, '<td valign="top">This picture is really interesting.  It seems to be focused right in the middle of the path.  I would have liked to see sharper focus in the front instead.  I like the lighting and the angels in it.</td>', 'This picture is really interesting.  It seems to be focused right in the middle of the path.  I would have liked to see sharper focus in the front instead.  I like the lighting and the angels in it.', '2003-08-12 02:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(384954, 31993, 8981, '<td valign="top">Very nice, and very hard to hold!  I think the lighting on the subject could have been brighter, I can barely see him.  I like this one.</td>', 'Very nice, and very hard to hold!  I think the lighting on the subject could have been brighter, I can barely see him.  I like this one.', '2003-08-12 02:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(384956, 31491, 8981, '<td valign="top">It took me a little while, but I figured out what the title was referring to.  This is a neat idea, but unfortunatly my focus is drawn up to the unlevel horizon, and not down to the roadway.  I think if you had perhaps cropped off the top and if possible zoomed in more on the roadway, this would have worked better.</td>', 'It took me a little while, but I figured out what the title was referring to.  This is a neat idea, but unfortunatly my focus is drawn up to the unlevel horizon, and not down to the roadway.  I think if you had perhaps cropped off the top and if possible zoomed in more on the roadway, this would have worked better.', '2003-08-12 02:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(385015, 31765, 10231, '<td valign="top">I like the spareness here.</td>', 'I like the spareness here.', '2003-08-12 05:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(385057, 31635, 9232, '<td valign="top">This seems slightly overexposed.  With the silver/gray in the FG and the white in the left BG, you could probably have taken off the exposure time just a little and gotten a clearer shot of the texture on the pipe.  <br/>This shot might also have benefited from a more shallow depth of field.</td>', 'This seems slightly overexposed.  With the silver/gray in the FG and the white in the left BG, you could probably have taken off the exposure time just a little and gotten a clearer shot of the texture on the pipe.  This shot might also have benefited from a more shallow depth of field.', '2003-08-12 08:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(385058, 32252, 9232, '<td valign="top">The dotted line is a good idea to accentuate the one line.</td>', 'The dotted line is a good idea to accentuate the one line.', '2003-08-12 08:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(385059, 32246, 9232, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion but the right angles don''t constitute the strength of this photo with the action of the water, the grounding brown tones of the hill and the light blue tones of the sky.</td>', 'Just my opinion but the right angles don''t constitute the strength of this photo with the action of the water, the grounding brown tones of the hill and the light blue tones of the sky.', '2003-08-12 08:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(385060, 32227, 9232, '<td valign="top">The soft focus doesn''t speak well for this composition.  I like the subject.</td>', 'The soft focus doesn''t speak well for this composition.  I like the subject.', '2003-08-12 08:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(385062, 32168, 9232, '<td valign="top">The right angles at the crenelations (I believe that''s what those are) are good and you have a long enough run of them so that they could be the subject against the blue sky but the tree/bush in the FG distracts from the angles. - 5</td>', 'The right angles at the crenelations (I believe that''s what those are) are good and you have a long enough run of them so that they could be the subject against the blue sky but the tree/bush in the FG distracts from the angles. - 5', '2003-08-12 08:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(385064, 31860, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great industrial shot.  I like the use of tone.  What tool and method did you use to make this black and white?  It still retains some good contrast with the shadows on the pipes.  The light on the horizontal pipes is a little strong; did you try to play with the lighting levels?</td>', 'Great industrial shot.  I like the use of tone.  What tool and method did you use to make this black and white?  It still retains some good contrast with the shadows on the pipes.  The light on the horizontal pipes is a little strong; did you try to play with the lighting levels?', '2003-08-12 08:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(385065, 32012, 9232, '<td valign="top">Great texture but the angles just make me feel like they''re not exact.  Of course that probably contributes to the organic ethos of this composition.  The lighting is just a little strong in the top right corner but its very close to perfect on the bottom piece.  Creative interpretation.</td>', 'Great texture but the angles just make me feel like they''re not exact.  Of course that probably contributes to the organic ethos of this composition.  The lighting is just a little strong in the top right corner but its very close to perfect on the bottom piece.  Creative interpretation.', '2003-08-12 08:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(385066, 31952, 9232, '<td valign="top">Creative shot.  The right angles of the hour and minute hand are accentuated by the 30 degree plus angle of the second hand at the bottom of the watch face.  Choosing to shoot the watch at an angle like this and with a reflection adds to the composition.  Good use of depth of field to bring the eye to where you want it focused.  The main detraction I see is what I assume to be window glare along the top of the watch (just between the 12 and 1).  The bright lights in the reflection behind the watch could be toned down in PS, too.</td>', 'Creative shot.  The right angles of the hour and minute hand are accentuated by the 30 degree plus angle of the second hand at the bottom of the watch face.  Choosing to shoot the watch at an angle like this and with a reflection adds to the composition.  Good use of depth of field to bring the eye to where you want it focused.  The main detraction I see is what I assume to be window glare along the top of the watch (just between the 12 and 1).  The bright lights in the reflection behind the watch could be toned down in PS, too.', '2003-08-12 08:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(385067, 32048, 9232, '<td valign="top">Challenging interpretation.  It commends itself for continued scrutiny.  The red background and the strong light from the left are impressive accompanists to the right angle that the forks create.  I don''t like the texture and shadow created in the red just below the juncture of the two forks nor am I crazy over the intense heat of the light off the topmost tine but all-in-all this was a creative idea and you pulled it off well.  I''m interested to see how it does on DPC.  My vote - 8</td>', 'Challenging interpretation.  It commends itself for continued scrutiny.  The red background and the strong light from the left are impressive accompanists to the right angle that the forks create.  I don''t like the texture and shadow created in the red just below the juncture of the two forks nor am I crazy over the intense heat of the light off the topmost tine but all-in-all this was a creative idea and you pulled it off well.  I''m interested to see how it does on DPC.  My vote - 8', '2003-08-12 08:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(385068, 31863, 9232, '<td valign="top">Creative idea but it seems to me that its someone else''s artwork.  The philosophy of a "right angle" person is a nice take on the challenge but . . . .  I''ll have to come back to this one.</td>', 'Creative idea but it seems to me that its someone else''s artwork.  The philosophy of a "right angle" person is a nice take on the challenge but . . . .  I''ll have to come back to this one.', '2003-08-12 08:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(385071, 32038, 8891, '<td valign="top">the colors in this are excellent, just wich that neither th guard nor the ''sneak'' were in the the shot.  The add nothing to it and distract tfromt he angles and the intricacies of the palace decoration. <br/>Oh and congrats on your POTD at Digicam Plus for this, Ding!</td>', 'the colors in this are excellent, just wich that neither th guard nor the ''sneak'' were in the the shot.  The add nothing to it and distract tfromt he angles and the intricacies of the palace decoration. Oh and congrats on your POTD at Digicam Plus for this, Ding!', '2003-08-12 09:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(385072, 32157, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the abstractness of this....I''m not sure I get the title.</td>', 'Like the abstractness of this....I''m not sure I get the title.', '2003-08-12 09:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(385073, 32231, 8891, '<td valign="top">Hey Harold, what are you doing up there.  Nice set up ,  is it a set piece, a real clock or something you put together?  In my mind, BW might have been better than a sepia tone, but it is fine as is.</td>', 'Hey Harold, what are you doing up there.  Nice set up ,  is it a set piece, a real clock or something you put together?  In my mind, BW might have been better than a sepia tone, but it is fine as is.', '2003-08-12 09:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(385074, 31862, 8891, '<td valign="top">You know perspective is always fascinating.  It blows my ming when you see a hurdles race filmed from this angle cause it just never seems like there is anyroom between the hurdles for the runners to to anything but hop over the next hurdle and not run in between.  very well done!</td>', 'You know perspective is always fascinating.  It blows my ming when you see a hurdles race filmed from this angle cause it just never seems like there is anyroom between the hurdles for the runners to to anything but hop over the next hurdle and not run in between.  very well done!', '2003-08-12 09:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(385075, 31615, 8891, '<td valign="top">not a fan of the frame that was added, am a fan of the framing of the model. nice texture contrasts, excellent comp.</td>', 'not a fan of the frame that was added, am a fan of the framing of the model. nice texture contrasts, excellent comp.', '2003-08-12 09:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(385076, 32235, 8891, '<td valign="top">just a building to me....</td>', 'just a building to me....', '2003-08-12 09:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(385077, 32226, 8891, '<td valign="top">like the negative DOF of the fingers and the flower is well shot. the added fram is quite distracting as it runs through the title subject.</td>', 'like the negative DOF of the fingers and the flower is well shot. the added fram is quite distracting as it runs through the title subject.', '2003-08-12 09:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(385078, 32036, 8891, '<td valign="top">super composition, great colors. I think for this challenge the post and rail should have been better lit as they should be the subject not the beautiful sunset in the  background</td>', 'super composition, great colors. I think for this challenge the post and rail should have been better lit as they should be the subject not the beautiful sunset in the  background', '2003-08-12 09:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(385079, 31292, 10696, '<td valign="top">So powerful and yet so soft. Great picture!</td>', 'So powerful and yet so soft. Great picture!', '2003-08-12 09:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(385095, 32240, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice shades of gray.....</td>', 'Nice shades of gray.....', '2003-08-12 10:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(385098, 32036, 3569, '<td valign="top">I like the subject off in the distance.  Mt. Hood I presume.  I would have cropped a bit off the left side to bring the eye to the mountain.  Good colors too.</td>', 'I like the subject off in the distance.  Mt. Hood I presume.  I would have cropped a bit off the left side to bring the eye to the mountain.  Good colors too.', '2003-08-12 10:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
