(385615, 31995, 8637, '<td valign="top">Beautiful rendition of this idea...excellent lighting.  The small lettering that seems to slant is only element that seems out of place.  Love this one, could be a winner!</td>', 'Beautiful rendition of this idea...excellent lighting.  The small lettering that seems to slant is only element that seems out of place.  Love this one, could be a winner!', '2003-08-12 21:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
