(385650, 32010, 8981, '<td valign="top">Nice!  This is a sexy, creative approach to the challenge.  Very refreshing.</td>', 'Nice!  This is a sexy, creative approach to the challenge.  Very refreshing.', '2003-08-12 22:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(385662, 32073, 7810, '<td valign="top">cool shot</td>', 'cool shot', '2003-08-12 22:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(385685, 32163, 8911, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting picture, but...although I can see some right angles, they don''t seem to be the strength of it. I can''t see the picture being weakened if the right angles were curves, or were gone. Nice composition and focus.</td>', 'This is an interesting picture, but...although I can see some right angles, they don''t seem to be the strength of it. I can''t see the picture being weakened if the right angles were curves, or were gone. Nice composition and focus.', '2003-08-12 23:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(385689, 31980, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2003-08-12 23:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(385690, 31823, 5925, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors on this shot, very artistically done, good composition.  I give it a solid 10.    Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful colors on this shot, very artistically done, good composition.  I give it a solid 10.    Good luck!', '2003-08-12 23:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(385705, 32241, 5925, '<td valign="top">Ooo I really like what you''ve done with the angle of this shot here.  Very creative and it makes it more interesting to look at.  It gets a 9 from me.</td>', 'Ooo I really like what you''ve done with the angle of this shot here.  Very creative and it makes it more interesting to look at.  It gets a 9 from me.', '2003-08-12 23:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(385709, 32010, 5925, '<td valign="top">This shot is way too dark for me.  Maybe better lighting would have given you a higher score.  Also, you really have to look at her legs to discover the ''right angle''.  5</td>', 'This shot is way too dark for me.  Maybe better lighting would have given you a higher score.  Also, you really have to look at her legs to discover the ''right angle''.  5', '2003-08-12 23:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(385710, 32225, 200, '<td valign="top">this is quite a cool shot...love the texture and color...its one of my favorites. But...I am wishing i could see the whole thing...makes me want more...what does the lower portion of this portal look like?</td>', 'this is quite a cool shot...love the texture and color...its one of my favorites. But...I am wishing i could see the whole thing...makes me want more...what does the lower portion of this portal look like?', '2003-08-12 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(385711, 32238, 200, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot....feels minimalist....and artistic. Nice job :)</td>', 'I really like this shot....feels minimalist....and artistic. Nice job :)', '2003-08-12 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(385712, 31570, 200, '<td valign="top">very nice shot!</td>', 'very nice shot!', '2003-08-12 23:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(385714, 31863, 200, '<td valign="top">i cant imagine anyone can complain about right angles lacking in this image! Who builds these things? Are there people getting paid to be lego artists? I need to look into this....good work, btw :)</td>', 'i cant imagine anyone can complain about right angles lacking in this image! Who builds these things? Are there people getting paid to be lego artists? I need to look into this....good work, btw :)', '2003-08-12 23:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(385718, 32080, 200, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. This reminds me of pleasant European summers. Now I want to travel! good luck in the challenge :)</td>', 'Very nice shot. This reminds me of pleasant European summers. Now I want to travel! good luck in the challenge :)', '2003-08-12 23:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(385720, 31651, 200, '<td valign="top">nice lighting...nice shot....nice and creative. Good luck with the challenge....i hope you do well.</td>', 'nice lighting...nice shot....nice and creative. Good luck with the challenge....i hope you do well.', '2003-08-12 23:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(385725, 31977, 200, '<td valign="top">cool shot :)</td>', 'cool shot :)', '2003-08-12 23:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(385726, 32030, 200, '<td valign="top">i love the texture and color in this...nice work</td>', 'i love the texture and color in this...nice work', '2003-08-12 23:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(385727, 31781, 200, '<td valign="top">thats a big stamp! I am left wondering why a city would choose this as a sculpture. I hope you explain it in your comments. It certainly has a lot of right angles though :)</td>', 'thats a big stamp! I am left wondering why a city would choose this as a sculpture. I hope you explain it in your comments. It certainly has a lot of right angles though :)', '2003-08-12 23:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(385728, 32203, 200, '<td valign="top">I like :)</td>', 'I like :)', '2003-08-12 23:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(385731, 31650, 200, '<td valign="top">thats funny :)</td>', 'thats funny :)', '2003-08-12 23:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(385732, 32025, 8159, '<td valign="top">The trees in the background almost looked "painted" -- perhaps intentional? Or perhaps too much sharpening. Personally I find the effect distracting. I''m having a hard time seeing how the green/red/yellow stripes give "strength" to this "Right Angles" image, although I do clearly see the right angles...</td>', 'The trees in the background almost looked "painted" -- perhaps intentional? Or perhaps too much sharpening. Personally I find the effect distracting. I''m having a hard time seeing how the green/red/yellow stripes give "strength" to this "Right Angles" image, although I do clearly see the right angles...', '2003-08-12 23:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(385736, 31615, 8159, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the broken bars in the photo are almost acting like pointers/arrows saying "look here!" Lots of right angles in this shot. My only comment is about the lack of detail in her outfit -- it all seems to blend together with hair, but I realize this is hard to get when shooting against a bright sky and then reducing it to "web size". Nice job.</td>', 'I really like the way the broken bars in the photo are almost acting like pointers/arrows saying "look here!" Lots of right angles in this shot. My only comment is about the lack of detail in her outfit -- it all seems to blend together with hair, but I realize this is hard to get when shooting against a bright sky and then reducing it to "web size". Nice job.', '2003-08-13 00:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(385747, 31936, 9232, '<td valign="top">Because of the lighting reflecting so strongly off the chess pieces and the directions for the challenge were that the right angle(s) was to create the strength of the image I don''t see this as a strong entry.  A softer light or lighting the board from behind might help the right angles to define the photo moreso than they currently do. 5</td>', 'Because of the lighting reflecting so strongly off the chess pieces and the directions for the challenge were that the right angle(s) was to create the strength of the image I don''t see this as a strong entry.  A softer light or lighting the board from behind might help the right angles to define the photo moreso than they currently do. 5', '2003-08-13 00:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(385751, 32065, 8159, '<td valign="top">There is a LOT of pixelization in this image -- either it has been "digitally zoomed" (which is a big no-no) or it was saved with a very low JPEG quality. All of the blockiness makes it difficult to judge the photo for what it is...</td>', 'There is a LOT of pixelization in this image -- either it has been "digitally zoomed" (which is a big no-no) or it was saved with a very low JPEG quality. All of the blockiness makes it difficult to judge the photo for what it is...', '2003-08-13 00:08:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(385752, 31814, 9232, '<td valign="top">Creative but even moreso, well composed.  Your idea is intriguing but the manner in which you chose to compose it commends this picture and your skills.  The red against the brown planks gives an off center point of interest and cropping both the planks on the left and bottom of the image and the top right corner so that they run off the image yields a particular feel to the image. 8</td>', 'Creative but even moreso, well composed.  Your idea is intriguing but the manner in which you chose to compose it commends this picture and your skills.  The red against the brown planks gives an off center point of interest and cropping both the planks on the left and bottom of the image and the top right corner so that they run off the image yields a particular feel to the image. 8', '2003-08-13 00:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(385753, 31627, 9232, '<td valign="top">It meets the directions for the challenge but it just doesn''t capture my attention.  Also the image is blownout at the bottom.  Vast divergence in light between the bottom and 1/3 up the image.  5</td>', 'It meets the directions for the challenge but it just doesn''t capture my attention.  Also the image is blownout at the bottom.  Vast divergence in light between the bottom and 1/3 up the image.  5', '2003-08-13 00:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(385756, 32148, 9232, '<td valign="top">Creative interpretation</td>', 'Creative interpretation', '2003-08-13 00:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(385759, 31993, 9232, '<td valign="top">The bright area in the top right corner detracts attention from the 90 degree angle of the subject.  Still, I scored this fairly high for its adherence to the directions while giving an organic feel - 7</td>', 'The bright area in the top right corner detracts attention from the 90 degree angle of the subject.  Still, I scored this fairly high for its adherence to the directions while giving an organic feel - 7', '2003-08-13 00:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(385764, 32128, 9232, '<td valign="top">Good idea and subject but you could have shot it from a different angle so that the visual representation reinforced the knowledge that this is a 90 degree angle.  In the photo it seems to be an obtuse angle.  The other horizontal lines are leaning as well (light poles and building).  I gave a decent score for your creative idea - 6</td>', 'Good idea and subject but you could have shot it from a different angle so that the visual representation reinforced the knowledge that this is a 90 degree angle.  In the photo it seems to be an obtuse angle.  The other horizontal lines are leaning as well (light poles and building).  I gave a decent score for your creative idea - 6', '2003-08-13 00:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(385775, 32048, 8159, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition. The only thing that bothers me a litlte bit is the reflections between the two forks -- it is somewhat distracting, and I keep looking at them trying to figure out what is making the reflections look the way they do. But maybe that is a good thing, because I''ve stared at your photo a long time... 8</td>', 'I really like this composition. The only thing that bothers me a litlte bit is the reflections between the two forks -- it is somewhat distracting, and I keep looking at them trying to figure out what is making the reflections look the way they do. But maybe that is a good thing, because I''ve stared at your photo a long time... 8', '2003-08-13 00:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(385776, 31516, 8610, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo, Simply love this one, Highest for this challange. Would maybe look better in duotones - 10</td>', 'Excellent photo, Simply love this one, Highest for this challange. Would maybe look better in duotones - 10', '2003-08-13 00:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(385778, 31849, 9331, '<td valign="top">Not sure where the right angles are in this shot?</td>', 'Not sure where the right angles are in this shot?', '2003-08-13 00:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(385779, 32238, 8610, '<td valign="top">This one works for me, Simple and impressive - 8</td>', 'This one works for me, Simple and impressive - 8', '2003-08-13 00:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(385784, 31553, 8610, '<td valign="top">The best Brick shot, worst it was to many of them -7</td>', 'The best Brick shot, worst it was to many of them -7', '2003-08-13 00:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(385796, 32075, 6900, '<td valign="top">Superior...as always.</td>', 'Superior...as always.', '2003-08-13 01:02:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(385797, 32075, 8953, '<td valign="top">I knew it! I knew it! Good job Sir! once again you did a great job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-08-13 00:04:30.</i></td>', 'I knew it! I knew it! Good job Sir! once again you did a great job!', '2003-08-13 01:04:04.000000', '2003-08-13 01:04:30.000000', 0),
