(385804, 31405, 9602, '<td valign="top">I got a few comments on how this didn''t have a right angle as the main subject.  I would just like to point out that the two up are at a right angle to the third, and also on the 2D plane of the picture they are also at right angles, so I recent those comments, but I''m not displeased with the resutlts.</td>', 'I got a few comments on how this didn''t have a right angle as the main subject.  I would just like to point out that the two up are at a right angle to the third, and also on the 2D plane of the picture they are also at right angles, so I recent those comments, but I''m not displeased with the resutlts.', '2003-08-13 01:08:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(385805, 32075, 1202, '<td valign="top">Knock ''em dead.  Congratulations, a winner all the way.</td>', 'Knock ''em dead.  Congratulations, a winner all the way.', '2003-08-13 01:09:19.000000', NULL, 0),
