(385904, 31378, 2700, '<td valign="top">This would have done way better if you have had raised your lens about 2 feet and angled it downwards more.. the contrast between the OLD wood and very rusted grate would look even cooler, not to mention you wouldn''t have gotten the "where are the Right Angles" comments as well</td>', 'This would have done way better if you have had raised your lens about 2 feet and angled it downwards more.. the contrast between the OLD wood and very rusted grate would look even cooler, not to mention you wouldn''t have gotten the "where are the Right Angles" comments as well', '2003-08-13 01:58:41.000000', NULL, 0),
