(386786, 31997, 9679, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who commented. I''m thrilled by some of the favorable responses I received. This was shot on a piece of black velveteen in low light and that helped make the background even darker. I actually had to desaturate the colors a tad so they wouldn''t overwhelm the whole.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who commented. I''m thrilled by some of the favorable responses I received. This was shot on a piece of black velveteen in low light and that helped make the background even darker. I actually had to desaturate the colors a tad so they wouldn''t overwhelm the whole.', '2003-08-13 14:26:52.000000', NULL, 0),
